<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="2.0">
  <book code="LUK" style="id">Luke</book>
  <para style="h">Luke</para>
  <para style="toc1">Luke</para>
  <para style="toc2">Luke</para>
  <para style="mt">Luke</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Eite lahah a tangtungsa thu zosie mi tampi in na giel zo a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />tuate pen a cil a kipanin mit tawh a mu mite le tua thu a na gente in ei na hilsawn bang tehteh ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />A zatahhuoi Theophilus aw, keima in zong a kipatcil a kipanin na zosie limtaha ka na kan zaw ciengin a thu a kizom diudeu-in nang adingin hing gielpieh leng hoi va, ci-in ka khensat hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tuaci’n nangma tunga ang kihilsa thute thuman thutah ahi lam na thei ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Judea gam Kumpi Herod hun lai-in Abijah’ suon siempu gui sung panin a min Zechariah a kici siempu khat a om hi. Ama’ zi pen Aaron’ suon hi a, a min Elizabeth ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />A ni gelin Pasien mai-ah midih ahi vua, Topa’ thupiehte le zui ding ngaina zosie genbaang loin a zui uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Ahi vangin Elizabeth pen a ciing ahi ziehin ta nei lo a, a ni gelin a kum uh a tam mama ta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Khatvei ama’ pawlte sep hun ding a tun ciengin Zechariah in Pasien mai-ah siempu nasep sem a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />siempute’ bawl zel ngaina a om bangin Topa’ mun siengtho sungah lutin panamtui hal ding, ci-in ai a kisan ciengin ama kiteel kha hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Panamtui a kihal hun sungin a kikhawm mi buppi in a pulamah thu a ngen uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tua ciengin ama kungah Topa’ vantungmi khat kilang a, panamtui kihalna maitam zietlamah a ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Zechariah in ama a mu ciengin lamdangsa-in zausi-in a kongawp hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Ahi vangin vantungmi in ama kungah, “Zechariah aw, zau sin, bang ding ahei cile na thungetna ka za zo ta hi. Na zi Elizabeth in tapa khat nei ding a, a min John na phuo ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Lungdamin na kipah ding a, ama ang pien ziehin mi tampi lungdam ding hi,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />azieh pen Topa muna-ah ama milien ahi ding hi. Ama in lenggazu ahi sihle khamthei poma a dawn ngai sih ding hi; a suo masang nangawnin Hlagau Siengtho tawh a kidim ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Ama in Israel mi tampitah, Topa a Pasien uh kungah a kiheisah ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Nu le pate’ lungtang a tate uh lamah, thumang lo mite’ lungtang a dih pilna lamah a kiheisah ding, Topa adingin mite a baisa-a koikhol dingin Elijah’ hlagau le vanglietna tawh a mai-ah a pei ding hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Zechariah in vantungmi kungah, “Tami thu bangci bangin theithei ding ka hei? Azieh pen kei lah vuoi ta’ng a, ka zi zong kum tam ta hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tua vantungmi in, “Kei Pasien’ nasem Gabriel ka hi hi. Nangma ang hopi ding le nang kunga tami lungdamna thu puoh dinga ei kisawl ka hi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Hinanle tu-in nang in a hun tun cienga ang tangtung ta valon ding ka thugente na up lo ziehin tami thute ang tangtun masangsie a ham thei loin na om ding hi,” ci-in a dawng hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Tua hun sung teng, mite in Zechariah a na ngah vua, biehinn sungah a kiheh ziehin lamdang a sa uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Ama a pusuo ciengin amate a hopi thei ta sih a, tua bepin biehinn sunga mangmu ahi lam a thei uhi. Ama a ham thei loin om den a, a khut tawh amate a hopi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />A siempu nasep hun a man ciengin a inn ah ama a pei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Tam teng zaw ciengin a zi Elizabeth gai a, hla nga sung innkui den hi. Ama in,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />“ Topa in kei dinga a sep tami ahi a, ka mite lahah ka thuoh maizumnate ei lah pieh a, maipha ei pie ta hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />A hla guhna ciengin, Pasien in Galilee gam Nazareth kici khuopi khatah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />David’ suon Joseph min nei pasal khat tawh kinung dinga zuthawl kipiesa ngahnu siengtho khat kungah vantungmi Gabriel a sawl hi. Tua ngahnu siengtho’ min pen Mary ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Ama pei-in tua nu kungah, “Maipha nga nu aw, nang kang hopi hi! Topa in nang ang ompi hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Hizongle ama’ thugenna ziehin lungmang mama a, bangci kihopi dan ahi ta bep diei, ci-in a lungsan dedu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Tua vantungmi in ama kungah, “Mary aw, zau sin, azieh pen Pasien’ maipha na mu zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Tu-in nang gai-in tapa khat na nei ding a, a min Jesu na vaw ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Ama milien hi ding a, Sang pen Pasien’ Tapa kici ding hi, Topa Pasien in a pa David’ kumpi topha ama a pie ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Jacob suonte tungah kumpi-in maang den ding a, a kumpi gam tawp hun ci om ngai lo ding hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Mary in vantungmi kungah, “Kei lah ngahnu siengtho khat hi bo ing a, tam thu bangci pien thei ding ahei?” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Vantungmi in, “Nangma tungah Hlagau Siengtho ang tung ding a, Sang pen Pasien’ vanglietna in nang ang lie ding hi; tua ahi zieh in ang suoh ding nausen pen siengtho ding a, Pasien’ Tapa kici ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Na tanau nu Elizabeth zong a teh a vuoi nua-in gai zo a, tu-in a ciing a kici nu a gai zaw a hla guhna ahi ta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Azieh pen Pasien ading in a pieng thei lo bangma om lo hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Tua ciengin Mary in, “ Topa’ nasem nu keima tanah om ing; na gen bangin ka tungah pieng taheh,” a ci hi. Tua ciengin ama kung panin vantungmi a peikhie hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Tua hunin Mary kisa mengmengin Judah muoltung gam khuo khatah haw a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Zechariah inn ah ama lutin Elizabeth a hopi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />Elizabeth in Mary’ hopina a zah ciengin a gil sunga nausen kitom a, Elizabeth zong Hla siengtho tawh kidimin,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />awging pi tawh, “Numeite lahah thupha nga nu na hi a, na gil sunga na paai nausen zong thupha nga ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" />Topa’ nu ang haw nadingin bang dingin tami thu kei tunga hing tung adiei?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" />Nei hopina awging ka bil tawh ka zah behin ka sunga nausen kipahin a kitom hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" />Topa in ama kunga a gensate a tangtung valon ding hi, ci-in a um tua numei khu thupha nga ahi hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" />Tuale Mary in, “Ka lungsim in Topa phat a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" />ka hundam pa Pasien sungah ka hlagau a kipah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" />A nasem nu’ tuolniemna ei enin maipha ei pei zo ahi ziehin, tu-a kipanin a khang a khanga mi zosie in thupha nga nu ei ci ding uhi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" />azieh pen vanglien pa in kei adingin na lienpite bawl zo a, ama’ min pen siengtho ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" />Ama a zatah mite tungah a khuotuona a khangkhangin a tung hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" />Ama in a ban tawh a thahatna lah a, kiphatsahna lungsim neite a thethang hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" />kumpi vangliente a kumpi topha pan khiesuhin, mi tuolniemte a tawisang hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" />a gilkiel mite na hoi tawh dim a, mihaute khutguohin a peisah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" />A khuotuona a phaw zing nadingun ama in a nasem Israel-te panpi zo a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="55" style="v" />i pute i pate tunga a gensa ma bangin Abraham le a suonlehlahte a khuotuo zing ding hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="56" style="v" />Elizabeth kungah hla thum bang a tam zaw ciengin inn ah Mary a peikia hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" />Elizabeth a nausuo ding hun tung a, ta pasal khat nei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="58" style="v" />Topa in ama tungah a khuotuona lah zo hi, ci thu a innvengte le a tanaute in thei-in Elizabeth tawh a lungdamton uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="59" style="v" />Ni gietna ni-in nausen teptan dingin a pei vua, a min dingin a pa min Zechariah ma phuo a sawm uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="60" style="v" />Ahi vangin a nu in, “Hi lo ding hi; ama pen John kici ding hi bo,” a ci hi. Amate in Elizabeth kungah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="61" style="v" />“Na be sung vuoh tam bang min koima’n phuo ngai sih,” a ci uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="62" style="v" />Tua ciengin a pa kungah bang min na phuo nuom ei, ci-in khut lim tawh a dong uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="63" style="v" />Ama in suonglai khat ngen a, “A min John ahi hi,” a ci leh amate a unpi-in a ciza uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="64" style="v" />Tuale thakhatin a kam kihongin a leii kihlam a, ama hamin Pasien a phat hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="65" style="v" />A innvengte zau-in Judea gam muoltung tengah tami thu zosie a gengen uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="66" style="v" />Tami thute a za mi zosie in, “Tua ahile tami nausen khu bangci nausen ang hi mawh diei?” ci-in a lungsan uhi. Azieh pen Topa’ khut in ama a ompi tahpi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="67" style="v" />Tua ciengin a pa Zechariah, Hlagau Siengtho tawh kidimin tam bangin thu a gen hi:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="68" style="v" />“Israel Topa Pasien in thupha nga taheh, azieh pen ama in a mite ve-in, a tankhie hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="69" style="v" />Ama in a nasempa David’ suon sung panin eite adingin a vanglien hundampa khat piengsah zo ta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="70" style="v" />Bangzieh ahei cile ama in tanglai-a kipan a siengtho a kamsangte tung panin a na gensa bangin,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="71" style="v" />i galte le ei mudate zosie’ khut sung panin hutdam a i op thei nading uh ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="72" style="v" />Tua bangin i pu i pate tunga a kamciemsa ahi, lungsietna a lah nading le, a siengtho ama’ thuciemna phawden nading ahi zongin,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="73" style="v" />i pu Abraham tunga a ciemsa tua kiciemna,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="74" style="v" />i galte khut sung pana ei hutkhiet nading, zau vawt lo-a ama’ na i sep thei nading,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="75" style="v" />i hin sung teng ama mai-ah siengthona le dihna tawh ama’ na i sep thei nading uh ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="76" style="v" />Tuale nang, nausen aw, Sangpen Pasien’ kamsang pa ang kici ding hi; azieh pen a lampi siel dingin Topa mai-ah na pei ding a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="77" style="v" />amau’ mawnate a maisahna tungtawnin a mite tungah hutdamna thu theitheina pieh thei nading ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="78" style="v" />A nunnem i Pasien uh’ ei hepina ziehin a sangna panin eite tungah phalvah ang tang ding a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="79" style="v" />khuomiel lahah a to mite le sina hlim nei-a om mite tungah khuovah pie-in kilemna lampi-ah ei pui ding hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="80" style="v" />Nausen khanglienin hlagau lamah thahat a, Israel mihonpi lahah a kilaa masangsie gamlahah a om hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Khum hun laitahin Kumpipa Caesar Augustus in leitung buppi mi phaza a kisim nadingin thu a pie hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tam pen Syria gam-uhpa Quirinius hun sunga kibawl mi phaza kisimna masa pen ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />A khuo ciet vuah min pie dingin mi zosie a pei uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Joseph zong David’ suon ahi ziehin Galilee gam Nazareth khuo panin Judea gam Bethlehem a kici David khuopi ah a pei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Zuthawl a piehsa le a gaituon Mary tawh min pie dingin ama a pei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Amate tuanah a tam sungun Mary a nausuo hun a tung hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />A tacil ahi ta pasal khat suoh a, tua nu in puonbeh tawh ama tunin gan ankuong sungah a siel hi, azieh pen zintun inn ah amate ading mun om lo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Khum gamah zan lai-in tuuhonte gamlahah a vil tuucingte a om uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tua ciengin a mai vuah Topa’ vantungmi khat dingin amau’ kimkotah Topa’ minthanna vang a tan ziehin a zau mama uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Ahi vangin vantungmi in amate kungah, “Zau sih un; en un, azieh pen mi zosie dinga kipahna lienpi ahi lungdamna thu note kungah kang puoh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tuni-in David khuo-ah Messiah Topa ahi hundampa khat note adingin a suoh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Note adingin a lim tam bang hi ding hi: Note in puonbeh tawh a kitun nausen khat, gan ankuong sunga kisiel na mu ding uhi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Thakhatthu-in vantung mite le vantungmi honpite a om vua,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />“Van a sangpen munah Pasien’ minthang hinlen, leitunga a maipha pieh mite lahah lemna om taheh!” ci-in Pasien a phat uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Vantung mite in amate nuasie-in vanah a ka zaw ciengun tuucingte in, “Tu-in Bethlehem khuo ah pei-in, Topa in ei theisah tami thupiengte va kan ta vai,” ci-in khatlekhat a kiho uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tuaci’n amate a naw pei mama vua Mary, Joseph le gan ankuong sunga kisiel nausen a mu uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tua banga a mu tah ciengun a kung vua kigen nausen tawh kisai thute mi a theisah uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tuucingte thugen a za zosie in lamdang a sa uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Ahi vangin Mary in a zah thute lungngai-in a lungsim sungah a vom khinkhian hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tuucingte zong kilekia-in amate kunga kigensa bangin a zahsa ule a musa uh thu zosie ziehin Pasien phatin a min a thangsah uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Nausen tep a kitan nading hun a ni gietna ni-in, a gai masanga vantungmi in a piehsa ahi Jesu kici min a vaw uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Moses’ thukham dung zui-in a kisiensuo ding uh hun a tun ciengin amate in Topa mai-a ap dingin Jerusalem ah ama a peipi vua,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />(Topa’ thukham sungah, “Ta pasal masa poma Topa adingin a siengtho-in kiciemte ding hi,” ci-in a kigiel bangin,)
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Topa’ thukham sunga a kigen dung zui-in biehpiehna-a pieh dingin, “Vakhu ni, ahi sihle paalva ni,” tawh a pei uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Khumin Jerusalem ah Simeon kici mi khat a om hi; ama pen midih le biehna lam pawnthaw khat le Israel-te’ kihenep ding hun zong a lamen mama pa khat ahi a, ama tungah Hlagau Siengtho a om hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Messiah Topa a mu masangsie a si lo ding thu zong ama tungah Hlagau Siengtho in a lahsa ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Hlagau lamlahna tawh biehinnpi sungah Simeon a pei hi; thukham sunga bawl ding ngaina teng a bawlpieh dingin nu le pate in biehinnpi sungah nausen a peipi ciengun,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />ama in a kang sungah nausen tawi-in Pasien min phat a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />“Mangpa aw, na kammal bangin, na nasempa tu-in lungnuomin nei hlakhie ta hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />azieh pen ka mit in mi zosie dinga na bawlkholsa
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />na hutdamna a mu zo ta a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Gentile-te tunga kihil nading khuovah le na mi Israel-te’ minthan nading ahi hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Nausen’ nu le pa te in ama tawh kisai-a thu kigente a zah ciengun lamdang a sa uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Tua ciengin Simeon in amate thupha pie a, tuale a nu Mary kungah, “Tami nausen pen Israel sungah mi tampi’ pua nading le a pohdawh nadinga kisesa ahi a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />tuaci’n mi tampite’ lungsim ngaisutnate pholahin kilangpanna a piengsah lim dinga zong kisesa ahi a, namsau khat in na lungsim ang sun pailet ding hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Khumin Asher’ be sung panin Phanuel’ tanu Anna a kici kamsang numei khat a om hi. Ama pen a khangham mama khat ahi a, a pasal tawh kinungin kum sagi sung a opton zaw cieng gelin,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />kum sawmgiet le kum li a phah dongin meigong khatin a om hi. Ama in sun le zanin antanna le thungetna tawh Pasien bie-in biehinnpi lawi ngai vawt lo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Tua hun laitahin ama pei-in Pasien kungah lungdam a ko a, Jerusalem kitatkhiet nading a lam-en mi zosie tungah tua nausen’ thu a gen hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Amate in Topa’ thukham in a kal zosie a bawl sieng zaw ciengun Galilee gam, a pienna uh khuo Nazareth ah a kilekia uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Nausen khangin thahat a, pilna tawh kidimin ama tungah Pasien maipha a om hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />Peisan pawi sim dingin kumsielin Jerusalem ah a nu a pate a pei uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />Jesu kum sawm le kum ni a phah ciengin a ngaina uh zui-in Jerusalem ah pawi sim dingin a peito uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" />Pawi ven ciengin a kilekia dingin a nu a pate a kisa ule naupang Jesu pen amau’ nualam Jerusalem ah tam lai a, ahi vangin a nu a pate in a thei kha sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" />Khuolzin honte tawh a zawhton a sa lel vua, ni khat lam a pei zo ta uhi. Tua ciengin a tanaute le a guolte lahah ama sui a kipan uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" />Ama a mu lo ciengun Jerusalem ah kilekia-in a sui uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" />Ni thum zaw ciengin biehinnpi sunga siete lahah to-in, a thugente uh ngai-in thu donga na om ama a mu uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" />A thugen a za tapo in a thutelna le a dawnkianate lamdang a sa uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" />A nu a pate in ama a mu ciengun, lamdang sa-in tuale a nu in, “Ka tano aw, bang dinga tam banga nei bawl ahei? En in, na pa tawh lunghimaw-in kang suisui uhi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" />Ama in a nu le a pa kungah, “Bang dinga nei sui uh ahei? Ka pa inn sunga ka op ding lamtah thei lo na hi uh amah?” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" />Hinanle a nu a pate in a thugente a tel thei sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" />Tua ciengin amate tawh Nazareth ah peisuh a, amau’ thu a mang hi. A nu in tam thute zosie a lungsim sungah a ciemte hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" />Jesu a pilna le a pumpi khangin Pasien le mite mai-ah maipha a nga hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Kumpipa Caesar Tiberius a maan zaw kum sawm le kumnga a cin kumin Pontius Pilat pen Judah gam uhpipa hi a, Herod, Galilee gam uhpa hi-in, a naupa Philip pen Ituraea le Trachonitis gamte a uhpa le Lysanias pen Abilene gam uhpa ahi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Annas le Caiaphas in siempu lienpen a sep laitahin senel gama a om Zechariah’ tapa John tungah Pasien’ kammal a tung hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Jordan gun kimvela om gam sung teng zosie-ah ama vah kawikawi-in mawna maisah nadingin kisiakiana tawh kisai baptize-na thu a hil hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Kamsang Isaiah’ thugente a kigielna laibu sungah, “Gamlahah a kiko mi khat’ aw in: ‘ Topa pei nading lampi siel unlen, a lampite tangsah un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Muolkuom cinteng kivuadim ding a, muol le tang zosie kito tamin, lamkawite kizezang ding a, lamphomte kimamsah ding hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />tuale mi zosie in Pasien’ hutdamna mu ding uhi,’ ci hi,” ci-a a kigiel bang ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />A ki-baptize sah dinga ama kung a zuon mihonpite kungah John in, “No muoltan suonte! Ang tung ding lungthahna pan na taimang nading uh koi in ang hil ahei?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Kisiakiana tawh kilawm ga na ga un. No le no in, “Abraham i pa uh ahi hi,” ci-in mawh gen sih un; azieh pen ke’n kang ci-in, Pasien in tami suongte panin Abraham tate piengsah thei lel hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tu nangawnin singzung cin tengah hei kikoi zo hi; ga hoi a ga lo singkung kici poma kiphua-in meikuong sungah kipai ding hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Mihonpite in, “Tua ahile bang ka bawl ding vuoi?” ci-in a dong uhi. Ama in,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />“Puon tungsil ni a nei pa in a nei lo pa hawm hinlen, an nei pa in zong tua bang ma-in bawl taheh,” ci-in a dawng hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />A ki-baptize dingin siehdongte nangawn a pei vua, ama kungah, “Sie aw, bang ka bawl ding vuoi,” ci-in a dong uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Ama in, “Na don ding vua a kisesa kan valin dong sih un,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Galkapte in zong, “Tuale kote in bang ka bawl ding vuoi?” ci-in a dong uhi. Ama in, “Zawthaw thu le a man lopi-a mawsahna tawh koima sum sut sih unlen, na thaman utawh lungkim un,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Lametna tawh mite a kidim vua, ama Messiah ahi kha ta diei, ci-in John tawh kisai-in a unpi-un a lungsim sung vuoh a ngaisut laitahun,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />John in amate zosie kungah, “Keima in tui tawh note kang baptize hi; ahi vangin kei sanga a vanglien zaw khat ang pei ding hi; a kedap khau sut dingin zong ka kilawm sih hi. Ama in Hlagau Siengtho le mei tawh note ang baptize ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Ama in buphuol zap sieng nadingin a khutah lawpi tawi a, butah teng sal sungah koi-in a siteng a mit ngai lo mei tawh a haltum ding hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tuaci’n John in hantotna tampi tawh mite kungah lungdamna thu a gen hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Ahi vangin gam uhpa Herod’ gitlo gamtatna teng zosie le a naupa’ zi Herodias ziehin John in Herod a hosiet ciengin,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Herod in tami thu teng zosie tawh belapin thong sungah John a khum hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Mi zosie a ki-baptize ciengin Jesu zong ki-baptize a, thu a nget laitahin van kihongin,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />tuale vakhu lim bangin ama tungah Hlagau Siengtho a kumsuh hi. Tuale van panin awging khat in, “Nang pen ka lung ei damsah ka it ka Tapa na hi hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Nasep a kipatin Jesu kum sawm thum bang pha a, ama pen (mite ngaituona-ah) Joseph’ tapa ahi a, Joseph pen Heli’ tapa,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Heli pen Matthat’ tapa, Matthat pen Levi’ tapa, Levi pen Melchi’ tapa, Melchi pen Jannai’ tapa, Jannai pen Joseph’ tapa,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Joseph pen Mattathias’ tapa, Mattathias pen Amos’ tapa, Amos pen Nahum’ tapa, Nahum pen Esli tapa, Esli pen Naggai’ tapa,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Naggai pen Maath’ tapa, Maath pen Mattathias’ tapa, Mattathias pen Semein’ tapa, Semein pen Josech’ tapa, Josech pen Joda’ tapa,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Joda pen Joanan’ tapa, Joanan pen Rhesa’ tapa, Rhesa pen Zerubbabel’ tapa, Zerubbabel pen Shealtiel’ tapa, Shealtiel pen Neri’ tapa,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Neri pen Melchi’ tapa, Melchi pen Addi’ tapa, Addi pen Cosam’ tapa, Cosam pen Elmadam’ tapa, Elmadam pen Er’ tapa,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Er pen Joshua’ tapa, Joshua pen Eliezer’ tapa, Eliezer pen Jorim’ tapa, Jorim pen Matthat’ tapa, Matthat pen Levi’ tapa,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Levi pen Simeon tapa, Simeon pen Judah’ tapa, Judah pen Joseph’ tapa, Joseph pen Jonam’ tapa, Jonam pen Eliakim’ tapa,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Eliakim pen Melea’ tapa, Melea pen Menna’ tapa, Menna pen Mattatha’ tapa, Mattatha pen Nathan’ tapa, Nathan pen David’ tapa,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />David pen Jesse’ tapa, Jesse pen Obed’ tapa, Obed pen Boaz’ tapa, Boaz pen Sala’ tapa, Sala pen Nahshon’ tapa,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Nahshon pen Amminadab’ tapa, Amminadab pen Admin’ tapa, Admin pen Arni’ tapa, Arni pen Hezron’ tapa, Hezron pen Pereg’ tapa, Pereg pen Judah’ tapa,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Judah pen Jacob’ tapa, Jacob pen Isaac’ tapa, Isaac pen Abraham’ tapa, Abraham pen Terah’ tapa, Terah pen Nahor’ tapa,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Nahor pen Serug’ tapa, Serug pen Reu’ tapa, Reu pen Peleg’ tapa, Peleg pen Eber’ tapa, Eber pen Shelah’ tapa,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Shelah pen Cainan’ tapa, Cainan pen Arphaxad’ tapa, Arphaxad pen shem’ tapa, Shem pen Noah’ tapa, Noah pen Lamech’ tapa,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Lamech pen Methuselah’ tapa, Methuselah pen Enoch’ tapa, Enoch pen Jared’ tapa, Jared pen Mahalaleel’ tapa, Mahalaleel pen Cainan’ tapa,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Cainan pen Enos’ tapa, Enos pen Seth’ tapa, Seth pen Adam’ tapa hi a, Adam pen Pasien’ tapa ahi hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Hlagau Siengtho tawh kidimsa-in Jordan gun panin Jesu kinuale kia-in, Hlagau in ama gamlahah zawpi a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />khum sungah dawimangpa in ni sawm li sung a ze-et hi. Ama in khum hun sung tungtawnin an bangma ne lo a, a ni a cin ciengin a gil kiel mama hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Dawimangpa in ama kungah, “Nang Pasien’ Tapa na hi leh tami suongte khomun a suo nadingin thu pie in,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Jesu in, ‘Mihingte khomun beh tawh a nungta hi lo hi,’ ci-in kigiel hi,” ci-in a dawng hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tua ciengin dawimangpa in muol dawnah Jesu peipi to a, leitung gam zosie bakhat sung lah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tuale dawimangpa in ama kungah, “Tam teng zosie keima tungah ei kipie zo ahi ziehin ka pieh nop popo ka pie thei hi; tami thuneina le thupina zosie nang tungah kang pie ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tua ahi ciengin kei nei bieh leh tam teng zosie a unpi-in nang-a’ hi ding hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Jesu in ama kungah, “’ Topa na Pasien bie inlen ama’ na beh sem in,’ ci-in kigiel hi,” ci-in a dawng hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tua ciengin dawimangpa in Jerusalem ah peipi a, biehinnpi khumvum ah koi-in ama kungah, “ Pasien’ Tapa na hi leh tam panin kumsuh in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Azieh pen, ‘Ama in nang ang cing dingin vantung mite thu pie ding a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />na keng suong tawh na tawhkhah lo nadingin a khut utawh nang ang dom ding uhi,’ ci-in kigiel hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tuale Jesu in, “’ Topa na Pasien na ze-et sin,’ ci-in kigiel hi,” ci-in a dawng hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Dawimangpa in a ze-et nading zosie a man sieng zaw ciengin hun lemtang a nga masangsie ama a peisan phot hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Hlagau’ vanglietna tawh kidimin Galilee gamah Jesu kilekia a, a kimvela gam sung zosie-ah ama thu a kizel hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />A kikhopna uh innte ah thuhil kipan a, mi zosie in ama a phat uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />A khankhietna Nazareth ah ama tung a, a pei ngaina bangin Sabbath ni-in kikhopna inn sungah a lut hi. Lai Siengtho sim dingin dingto a, tuale
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />kamsang Isaiah laiziel khat kipie hi. Ama in tua laiziel a phen leh tam bang teng kigielna mun a mu hi:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />“Keima tungah Topa’ Hlagau ang om hi, azieh pen mizawngte kungah lungdamna thu a gen ding, sal tang mite kungah suotahna thu a phuongzah ding, mittawte in khuo mukia-in, gawtna a thuoh mite in suotahna a nga thei nading le
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Topa’ angvan hun a genkhie dingin ama in keima sathau ei nu zo hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tuale ama in tua laiziel a khup dawh a, kikhopna inncingpa kungah pie-in a tosuh hi. Kikhopna inn sunga a om mi zosie in ama mittuhna-in a nei uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Tua ciengin amate kungah thugen ding kipan a, “Tuni-in na zahna vuah tami Lai Siengtho tangtung zo hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Mi zosie in ama a genpha vua, a kam pana a pusuoh a kilawm ama’ kammal hoite lamdang sa uh ahi ziehin, “Tam pa Joseph’ tapa hi lo amah?” a ci uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Ama in a kung vuah, “’Sievuonpa aw, nang le nang kidamsah in! ci tami paunah pen keima tungah nang zang valon ding vua, ‘Tam na pienna khuo-ah zong Capernaum khuo-a na sil bawl ka zahte uh hing bawl in,’ nei ci ding uhi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Ama in, “A tahtah a kang ci-in, a pienna khuo-ah kamsang koima khat beh a kisang om lo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Ahi vangin a tahtahin ci leih, Elijah hunin kum thum le alang sung van kikhah a, guo zu loin mun zosie-ah kielpi a tun lai-in, Israel-te sungah meigong numei tampi a om hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Ahi vangin Sidon gam Zarephath khuo meigong nu khat kungah ci simlo meigong koima dangte kungah Elijah kisawl lo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Kamsang Elisha hun lai-in Israel-te sungah miphah tampi om a, ahi vangin Syria mi Naaman ci sim lo koima kidamsah lo hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Tami thu a zah ciengun kikhopna inn sunga a om mi zosie a lungthah mama uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Amate dingto-in khuo pulamah ama a notmang vua, kensang dawn panin a bungbu lama a sawnthop thei nadingun a khuopi uh kilamna muoldawn kenah a peipi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Ahi vangin Jesu in amau’ laizang nawhin a peimang ta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Galilee gam Capernaum khuo ah ama peisuhin Sabbath ni-in amate thu a hil hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Amate in a thuhilna lamdang a sa uhi, azieh pen ama in thuneina tawh thu a gen giap hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Khumin kikhopna inn sungah hlabua a nei pasal khat om a, ama nahpi-in kiko-in,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />“Nazareth mi Jesu aw, ko guoh ei omsah lel ven! Ko bang ei law nuom na hei? Ko ei susie dinga ang pei na hi amah? Pasien’ Misiengtho Pa na hi lam kang thei hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Ahi vangin Jesu in “Ham sinlen ama kung panin pusuoh in!” ci-in a hosie hi. Tua dawi in amate mai-ah ama puasah a, bangma law loin a sung panin a pusuoh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Amate in a unpi-un lamdang a sa vua, “Tami thu bangci dan adiei? Azieh pen ama in thuneina le vanglietna tawh hlabuate thu a pieh ciengin a taimang uhi,” ci-in khatlekhat a kiho uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Tuale tua kuom muncin tengah ama’ thu a kizel hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Kikhopna inn panin a pei zaw ciengin Simon inn ah ama a lut hi. Tua laitahin Simon’ sungnu cithuo-in gim mama a, Jesu kungah ama adingin huna a ngen uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Tua ciengin tua nu kungah ama ding phei a, a cithuo natna a hosiet ciengin ama a dam pai hi. Thakhatin tua nu thoto-in zindo a kipan pai hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Ni tum ciengin ama kungah natna tuomtuom a nei mi zosie a peipi vua, ama in a tung vuoh khut nga-in a damsah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />Mi tampi sung panin dawite zong a pusuoh vua, “Nang Pasien’ Tapa na hi hi!” ci-in a kiko uhi. Hinanle dawite in ama Messiah ahi lam a thei ziehun tuate phawhsie-in thu a gensah sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />Khuo a vah ciengin khum mun panin mun sip khatah a peikhie hi. Tuale mihonpi in ama a sui uhi; ama a mu ciengun amate a nuasie lo nadingin a hlo uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" />Hinanle Jesu in amate kungah, “Khuopi dangte ah zong Pasien’ manggam lungdamna thu ka tangko ding hi; azieh pen tami dinga ei kisawl ahi hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" />Tuaci’n Judea gam sunga kikhopna innte ah ama in thu a hil suoh hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="5" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Khatvei Genesaret buol gei-ah Jesu ding a, mipite in Pasien thu ngai dingin ama a nehgawp laitahin,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />ama in buol gei-a om gunkuong ni a mu hi; tua gunkuongte sung panin ngabengte peikhie-in a lente a sawp sieng uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tua gunkuongte sung panin Simon’ gunkuong tungah ama tuong a, pieugei panin tawm khat a khin nadingin a sawl hi. Tua ciengin ama to-in gunkuong sung panin mihonpite thu a hil hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />A thugen a manzaw ciengin ama in Simon kungah, “Tui thuhna lamah na gunkuong hot inlen, na len tawh nga khu in,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Simon in, “Mangpa, zanthapai-in ka na khu vangun bangma khat zong ka man sih uhi. Hizongle khu in nei cileh lah khu mawh ta veng,” ci-in a dawng hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tua bangin len a khu uleh nga tam awh seng ahi ziehin a len uh a keh khiel vawt hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Gunkuong dang khat-a om a guolte pei a, a hu dingin a khutzap uhi. Tuale amate zong pei-in gunkuong tegel sungah nga a dimin a koi ziehun tui sungah a tum dihtah uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Ahi vangin Simon Peter in tua thu a mu bepin Jesu mai-ah khupdin a, Topa aw, mawnei mi khat ka hi ziehin kei kung panin peikhie in!” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Azieh pen nga tuaza a mat thei uh ama le a pawlte zosie in lamdang a sa uhi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />tua ma bangin Simon kipawlpi Zebedee’ tapate ahi James le John-te in zong lamdang a sa uhi. Tua ciengin Jesu in Simon kungah, “Zau sin; tu-a kipanin mihingte na man ding hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tuipieu-ah a gunkuongte uh a khawlsah zaw ciengun amate in na zosie nuasie-in ama a zui uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Khumin khatvei, khuopi sung khatah ama a op laitahin a pumtanga a phah mi khat pei a, Jesu a mu bepin tuolah khupbawh a, “ Topa aw, ei damsah nuom po lacin nei damsah thei hi,” ci-in a thum hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tua ciengin Jesu in a khut zahin tham a, “Kang damsah nuom hi. Dam ta in,” a ci leh thakhatin a phah natna in ama a nuasie pailien hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Koima kungah gen sin, ci-in ama thu a pie hi. Ama in, “Pei inlen, siempu pa kungah va kilah tanlen, Moses’ thupieh dung zui-in amate tungah teci ahi dingin na sienna ziehin biehpiehna va bawl ta’n,” ci-in thu a pie hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Ahi vangin nidang sangin ama’ thu a kizel semsem hi; mi tampitahte a thungai ding le a natnate uh a dam nadingin a kikhawm uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Ahi vangin gamdai-ah ama kihem dawhin thu a ngen hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Nikhat Jesu in thu a hil laitahin ama gei-ah Galilee gam, Judea gam, le Jerusalem pana ang pei Pharisee-te le thukham hil siete a to uhi. Tuale natna damsah nading Topa’ vanglietna in ama tungah a om hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tua zaw ciengin mi pawlkhat pei-in phalsi mi khat a lupna tawh a zawng uhi. Amate in inn sungah ama tumpi-in Jesu mai-a siel dingin a hanciem uhi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />ahi vangin mihonpi tam seng ahi ziehin a lutpi nading uh lampi a mu zo sih vua, tua bepin innkhumah kato-in a khumvang panin mipite laikim Jesu mai sontah ah a lupna pumin a khiesuh uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Ama in a upna uh a mu ciengin, “Lawm aw, na mawna teng kimaisah zo hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Tua ciengin thukham hil siete le Pharisee-te a kiho vua, “Pasien a gensie tam pa koi ahei? Pasien longal koi in mawna maisah thei ahei?” ci-in thudawh ding a kipan uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Jesu in a thudawh uh a thei ciengin amate kungah, “Na lungsim sung vua bang dinga tua bang thute na dawh uh ahei?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />‘Na mawnate kimaisah zo hi’ ci ding le ‘Tho inlen lampei in,’ ci ding koi baizaw ahei?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Ahi vangin Mihing Tapa in leitungah mawna maisah thei nading thuneina a nei lamtah na thei nadingun phalsi pa kungah, “Nang kungah kang ci-in, tho inlen na lupna puo-in na inn ah pei in,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Tua pa zong thakhatin amate mai-ah tho-in a lupna puo a, Pasien phat kawmin a inn ah a pei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Amate in a unpi-un lamdang a sa vua, a zau kawmun Pasien phatin, “Eite in tuni-in na lamdang i mu zo ta uhi,” a ci uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Tua zaw ciengin Jesu a pusuoh leh siehdonna zuma a to Levi kici siehdong khat mu a, ama in, “Ei zui in,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Tuale ama in zong na zosie nuasie-in ama a zui hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Tua ciengin Levi in a inn ah Jesu adingin anneh pawi khat a bawl hi; siehdong honpite le midangte in amate tawh ankuong a imton uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Pharisee-te le thukham hil a siete un a nuazuite kungah, “Bang dinga siehdongte le mawneite tawh neton dawnton na hi uh ahei? ci-in a mawsiet uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Jesu in, “Sievuon a tulmaw pen cidamte hi loin cinate hizaw hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Midihte hlan dinga ang pei ka hi sih a, mawneite a kisiakia nadinga ang pei ka hizaw hi,” ci-in a dawng hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Tua ciengin amate in ama kungah, “John’ nuazuite in Pharisee-te’ nuazuite bangin an tangin thu ngen zel napi, na nuazuite ahile an ne tui dawnin a om uhi,” a ci uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Jesu in amate kungah, “Mopawi simte in zi nei ding pa tawh a om sungun an na tangsah thei ding uh amah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Amate kung panin zineipa a kilahdawh hun ang tung ding a, khum ni ciengin amate in an a tang ding uhi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Jesu in amate kungah thugentena khat tawh thu a gen hi: “Koima in puon tha ehkehin puonsie phawna-in a zang sih hi; tua banga a bawl leh a puontha ehkeh ding a, puontha beh le a lui a kituoh thei sih ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Koima in savun umlui sungah lenggazu tha a thal sih hi; a tuaci bawl leh lenggazu tha in savun um pawhkeh sahin lenggazu phulmang ding a, savun um a kisie ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Lenggazu tha pen savun um tha sunga thal ding hizaw hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Koima in lenggazu lui a dawn zaw ciengin lenggazu tha a lunggul ta sih a, ‘Lenggazu lui ma tuizaw hi,’ ci hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="6" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Sabbath ni khatin mangbu leite nawhin Jesu a pei laitahin a nuazuite in mangbuvui a zut vua, a khut utawh nuoi-in a ne uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Ahi vangin Pharisee-te pawlkhat in, “Sabbath ni-a bawl dinga kilawm lo nate bang dinga na bawl uh ahei?” a ci uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Jesu in, “David in a pawlte tawh a gilkiel laitahun bang bawl ci na sim ngai sih uh amah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Pasien biehinn sungah lutin siempute longal midangte’ neh dinga a kilawm lo Ompina Anlum la-in ne a, a pawlte zong pie lai hi lo amah?” ci-in a dawng hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tua ciengin amate kungah, “Mihing Tapa pen Sabbath’ uhpa ahi hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Sabbath ni dang khatin kikhopna inn sungah ama lutin thu hil a, tua munah a zietlam khut a zaw mi khat a om hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tuale thukham hil siete le Pharisee-te in ama a mawmat thei nadingun Sabbath ni-in mi ang damsah mawng ei mah, ci-in ama a kai-hlit uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />A ngaisutnate uh a thei vangin ama in khutzaw mipa kungah, “Hing pei inlen tanah hing ding ta’n,” a ci hi. Ama thoto-in tua munah a ding pai hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tua ciengin Jesu in amate kungah, “Note kang dong hi, sabbath ni-in a sie bawl ding le a pha bawl ding, hinna hutdam ding le suhsiet ding, koi pen thukham tawh a kituoh ei?” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Amate zosie a et kawikawi zaw ciengin Jesu in tua pa kungah, “Na khut zah vawi,” a ci hi. Ama in tua bangin a zah leh a khut a ngaingai a bangkia hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Ahi vangin amate a lungthah mama vua, Jesu bang i law thei diei, ci-in khatlekhat a kikum uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Khum hunlai-in thugen dingin muoltungah Jesu kato a, zan thapai-in Pasien kungah thu ngen hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Khuo ang vah ciengin ama in a nuazuite hlanin mi sawm le ni teel a, tua teng sawltahpite ci-in minvaw hi:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Peter ci-a min a vaw pa Simon le a sanggampa Andrew, James le John, Philip, Bartholomew,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Matthew le Thomas, Alpheaus’ tapa James le Zealot kici Simon,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />James’ tapa Judas le a lehehpa Judas Iscariot-te ahi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Ama in a nuazui mihon tampite le Judea, Jerusalem, Tyre le Sidon tuipi dung pana a pei mi zosie tawh kumsuhin munzang khatah a ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Amate ahile a thugen ngai ding le a natna uh panin damna a nga nuom zieh vua pei uh ahi hi; tuale hlabua in a bawlsiet mite zong kidamsah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tuale ama tung panin vanglietna pusuohin amate a unpi-un a damsah ziehin, mihonpi zosie in ama tham ding a hanciem uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tua ciengin Jesu in a nuazuite ento a: “No mizawngte thupha nga na hi uhi, azieh pen Pasien’ manggam noma-a’ ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Tulai taha a gilkielte thupha nga na hi uhi, azieh pen na gil uh a va ding hi. Tu-a a kap a maute thupha nga na hi uhi, azieh pen na nui ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />“Mihing Tapa ziehin mite in hing muda-in ang puse vua, hing hosie-in ang gensiet ciengun mi hampha na hi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Vantunga na nga ding uh thaman lien mama ahi ziehin tua bang hun ciengin kipahin dieng un, azieh pen a pu a pate un zong kamsangte tungah tua bangin a bawl uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />“Ahi vangin no mihaute in gimna na thuoh ding uhi, azieh pen note in henepna na nga zo uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Tu hun a a gilva note in gimna na thuoh ding uhi, bangzieh ahei cile note na gilkiel ding uhi. Tu hun a a nui note in gimna na thuoh ding uhi, bangzieh ahei cile note kapin na mau ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />“Mi zosie in ang genphat ciengun gimna a thuoh ding na hi uhi, bangzieh ahei cile a pu a pate un zong kamsang zuoute tungah tua bangin a bawl uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />“Ahi vangin ka thugen a ngai note kungah kang ci-in, na galte na it unlen, ang mudate tungah a pha na bawl un,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />ang samsiete thupha na pie unlen ang bawlsiete adingin thu na ngetpieh un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Mi khatpo in na pheta uh ang beh leh a langkhat zong na daw un; mi khatpo in na puon tungsil uh ang lahpieh leh na songkhol uh nangawn na piehbe un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Na kung vua na ang ngen poma pie unlen, na van uh a late kungah ngenkia nawn sih un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />No tunga ang kibawl ding na dei bangun midangte tungah zong na bawl un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />“No ang itte beh na it uleh na lemlaw uh bang ahei? Azieh pen mawneite nangawn in amate a itte a it uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Na tung vua a pha bawlte tung behah a pha na bawl uleh, na lemlaw uh bang ahei? Azieh pen mawneite nangawn in zong tua bangin a bawl uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Ngakia ding lametna tawh mi sum na leitawi uleh na lemlaw uh bang ahei? Mawnei mite nangawn in a leitawi zaza a ngakia nadingun mawnei dangte a leitawi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Hinanle na galte it unlen a pha bawl un, ngakia ding bangma lamen loin leitawi pie un. Tua hileh na thaman uh lien ding a, Sangpen Pasien’ tate na hi ding uhi; azieh pen ama in lungdam dan thei lote le mi gilote tungah a migi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Na Pa un mi a khuotuo ma bangin note in zong mi na khuotuo un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Thu na khen sih un, tua hile no tungah zong thu ang kikhen sih ding hi; mi na mawsah sih un, tua hile no zong ang kimawsah sih ding hi. Mite’ maw maisah un, tua hile no zong ang kimaisah ding hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />pie un, ang kipie ding hi. A tena hoi, a kibetlawt, a kitawkhet, le a dimletin na kang sung vuah ang kisung ding hi; azieh pen na te zaza ma uh na ngakia ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Ama in amate tungah thugentena khat zong a gen hi: “Mittaw khat in mittaw dang khat lam a hil thei ding amah? A ni gelin guom sungah a kieton ta sih ding uh amah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Nuazui khat a siepa sangin a lienzaw ngai sih hi, ahi vangin mi khatpo a picingsa ahi zaw ciengin a siepa tawh a kibang ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />Bang dinga nangma’ mit a singluong kikham phawh kha lopi-in na vengpa’ mit a buathah them na muthaw ahei?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />Ahi sihle nangma’ mit a singluong kikham mu lopi-in bang dingin na vengpa kungah, ‘Lawm aw, na mit a buathah nang lahpieh vang’ na ci thei ahei? No, mihoi kipangte aw, na mit vua singluong lakhie masa phot unlen, tua zaw ciengin na vengpa’ mit a buathah hoitahin mu-in na lahpieh thei pan ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" />Singkung hoi in ga hoi lo ga ngai lo a, singkung hoi lo in ga hoi ga ngai lo hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" />azieh pen singkung zosie a ga tawh kitheithei hi. Lingkung panin theiga kilo ngai lo a, thangling kung panin zong lengga kilo ngai lo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" />Mihoi in a lungtanga a vom thuhoite a suokhie a, migilo in a lungtanga a vom gitlonate a suokhie hi; azieh pen lungtang sungah a dimlet ciengin kam tawh kisuokhie hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" />“ Topa, Topa ei ci napi ucin, bang dinga ka thugente na man lo uh ahei?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" />Ka kungah hing pei-in ka thugen za a, ka gen banga a gamta zosiete bang tawh kibang ahei, ci thu kang lah ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" />Tua mipa pen lei a thuh taw zaw cienga suongpi tunga khuomkuo ding a phutkip inn lampa tawh kibang hi; tui khangin hawhtuite in tua inn a nawh vangin hoitaha kilam ahi ziehin a kilawh zo sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" />Ahi vangin ka thu za-a a mang lo mi in doppha a nei lo, leitang tunga innlam pa tawh kibang hi. Hawhtui in tua inn khautahin a nawh ciengin thakhatin pua pai a, tua inn pen a nahsiet mama hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="7" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Jesu in mite’ zahin a thugen ding zosie a man zaw ciengin Capernaum khuo ah a lut hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tua sungah galkapmangpa khat in a it mama sila khat nei a, tuapa cina-in si dihtah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Ama in Jesu’ thu a zah ciengin ama kungah Judah upa pawlkhat sawl a, ama pei-in a sila pa a damsah nadingin amate a thumsah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Jesu kungah a tun ciengun amate in nahpitahin a thum vua, “Ama tua banga na bawlpieh dinga kilawm ahi hi,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />bangzieh ahei cile ama in i minamte it a, i kikhopna inn zong ei lampieh hi,” a ci uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Amate tawh Jesu zawhton a, a inn tawh a kigamla lo mun khat a tun ciengin galkapmangpa in ama kungah a guolte sawlin, “ Topa aw, nang le nang gim kipie da in, azieh pen ka inn sunga nang kang lutsah ding kei adingin a kilawm sih hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />tua ahi ziehin kei zong nang kunga ang pei dingin kilawm ka kisa sih hi. Ahi vangin kamteng khat beh hing gen zieu inlen, ka silapa hing damsah ta’n.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Bangzieh ahei cile kei zong uhna khut nei-a a om khat ka hi a, ka nei-ah galkap tampi a om hi; mi khat kungah, “Pei in,” ka ci leh a pei a, adang khat kungah ,“Hing pei vawi,” ka ci leh ang pei pai a, tuale ka silapa kungah, “Tami bawl in,” ka ci leh ka silapa in a bawl pai hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Jesu in tami thu a zah ciengin lamdang sa a, ama a zui mipite lamah kihei-in, “Note kungah kang ci-in, Israel-te lah nangawnah zong tam bang upna ka mu ngai nai sih hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Innah a kisawlte a tun ciengin amate in silapa a cidamsa-in a mu uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tua zaw a sawt loin Nain kici khuo ah ama pei a, a nuazuite le mihonpi zong ama tawh a zawhton uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Khuopi tunkot a tun kuon ciengun vui dingin mi sisa khat na kizawng hi. Ama pen a nu in tapa khat tanga a nei ahi mel a, ama zong meigong khat ahi hi; tua khuopi panin tua nu tawh mi honpite a om uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Topa in tua nu a mu bepin a khuotuo nah mama a, ama kungah, “Kap sin,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tua ciengin a mai lamah ama pei-in misi puohna lanng a tham leh a puote zong a dinkhawl vawt uhi. Tuale ama in, “Tangval pa, tho in kang ci hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Misipa thoto-in thugen a kipan pai a, tua bepin Jesu in a nu kungah tuapa a apkia hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Amate a unpi-un a zausi sieng vua, Pasien’ min phatin, “Eite lahah kamsang thupi khat ang pieng zo ta! Pasien in angvanna tawh a mite ei ve zo ta!” a ci uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Judea gam buppi le a kimvela gam zosie-ah ama’ thu a kizel sieng hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />John’ nuazuite in ama kungah tam thu zosie a gen uhi. Tuaci’n John in a nuazuite ni hlan a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Topa kungah, “Ang pei ding pa na hi amah, ahi sihle adang khat ka lamen lai ding vuoi mah?” ci-in a dong dingin ama gel a sawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Jesu kungah tua tegel a tun ciengun ama gel in, “Ang pei ding pa na hi amah, ahi sihle adang khat ka na lamen lai ding vuoi mah?” ci-a dong dingin Baptize-pa John in kogel ei sawl ahi hi,” a ci uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Tua hun laitahin Jesu in natna tampi tah, pulnatna le hla gilo veite damsah a, mittaw tampitah zong khuo a musah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Ama in ama gel kungah, “Pei unlen, na zahsa thute ule na mu thute uh John kungah va gen ta un: Mittawte in khuo mu a, khelbaite lam pei thei-in, miphahte kidamsah a, bilbingte in khuo za-in, misite kithosah a, mizawngte tungah lungdamna thu kipuoh zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Keima zieha a lungkie lo poma mi hampha ahi hi,” ci-in a dawng hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />John’ kamtaite a pei zaw ciengun mipite kungah John’ thu a gen dingin Jesu kipan a, “Gamlahah bang en dinga pei na hi vuoi? Hui’ mut a a zam kawikawi pumpeng amah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Tua ahi sihle bang en dinga pusuoh na hi vuoi? Puon hoi sil mi pawlkhat en nuom na hi uh amah? En un, puon hoi silte kumpipa inn sungah a om uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Tua ahile bang en dinga pusuoh na hi vuoi? Kamsangpa khat amah? Hi hi, ke’n kang ci-in, kamsangpa sangin a lienzaw hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />‘En in, na mai-ah ka kamtaipa ka sawl ding a, ama in na mai-ah na pei nading lampi a na sielkhol ding hi,’ ci-a kigiel pa khu tampa ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />A tahtah a kang ci-in, numeite sunga a suohte lah panin Baptize-pa John sanga a lienzaw koima a om sih hi; hizongle Pasien’ manggam sungah a neu pen khat nangawn ama sangin a lienzaw hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />(Siehdongte-a kipanin mi zosie in tami thu a zah uh ciengin Pasien pen thutang hi, ci-in a sang uhi, bangzieh ahei cile amate John kunga na ki-baptze sa ahi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Ahi vangin Pharisee-te le thukham hil siete in John’ baptize ding a niel ziehun amau’ phattuomna ding ahi Pasien gelna a nol uh ahi hi.)
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />“Tua ahile tami khang mite bang tawh ka gente ding a, bang tawh kibang ci ding ka hei?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Vanzuana munah amate to a, ‘Theile ka tum vangun na lam nuom sih vua, kaa-la ka sah vangun na kap nuom tuon sih uhi,’ ci-a khatlekhat a kigal hlat naupangte tawh a kibang uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Azieh pen bangma ne lo dawn loin John ang pei-in note in, “Dawi lawmnei pa,’ na ci uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Mihing Tapa ang pei ciengin an ne tuidawnin a om a, ‘En un, anhai zuhai pa, siehdongte le mawneite’ guolpa!’ na ci vanuh uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Hinanle pilna pen a man a hina a tate zosie tung panin kilang veve hi,” ci-in a gen hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Pharisee-te khat in ama tawh an ne dingin Jesu hlan a, tuale Pharisee pa inn ah pei-in an ne dingin sabuoi-ah a to hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Tuami khuo-a mawnei numei khat in Pharisee pa inn ah Jesu in an ne ding hi, ci a thei bepin sathau namtui suongngo thawl khat a tawi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />A nualam a keng phungah tua nu dingin kap a, a hlitui tawh a keng silpiehin, a sam tawh a nawtgumpieh hi. Tua ciengin a keng namin sathau a nupieh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Ama a hlan Pharisee mipa in a mu ciengin a lungsim sungah, “Tampa kamsang khat ahileh ama a tham nu koi hi a, bangci numei ahei, ci a thei ding hi; azieh pen ama mawnei ahi hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Jesu in ama kungah, “Simon aw, kang gen nop khat om hi,” a ci hi. Ama in, “Siepa,” ci-in dawng a, “Gen in,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />“Sum palah mipa khat in leiba mi ni a nei hi; khat in denari za nga ba-in, adang khat in sawm nga ba hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />Tua gel in a leiba uh a lo zawh lo ciengun, ama in a ni gelin a leiba uh a maisah hi. Tuale tua tegel koi pen in ama itzaw ding ahei?” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" />Simon in, “A leiba a tamzaw kimaisah pa hi va, ci-in ngaisun ing,” ci-in a dawng hi. Tuale Jesu in ama kungah, “Dihtahin na khen zo hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" />Tua ciengin numei nu lamah Jesu kihei-in, ama in Simon kungah, “Tami numei na mu ei mah? Na inn ah keima kang lut hi; ka keng sil nading tui nei pie sih a, hinanle ama in a hlitui tawh ka keng pah tehhopsah a, a sam tawh ei nawtgumpieh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" />Nang in nei nam sih a, ahi vangin a inn sung ka lut a kipanin ama in ka keng a nam den hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" />Nang in ka lu sathau nei nupieh sih a, ahi vangin ama in ka keng sathau namtui ei nupieh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" />Tua ahi ziehin ke’n kang ci-in, ama’ mawna tampitah kimaisah zo hi; tua ahi ciengin tua nu in itna lien a lah zo hi. Ahi vangin a kitawm maisahte in a tawm it pai uhi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" />Tua ciengin ama in tua nu kungah, “Na mawna teng kimaisah zo hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" />Hinanle amate lahah Jesu tawh sabuoi-a an a imton mite in, “Mawnate nangawn a maisah vazuou tampa koi ahiei?” a ci uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" />Tuale Jesu in numei nu kungah, “Na upna in nang ang hundam zo hi; lungmuong tahin pei in,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="8" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tua zaw bakhat ciengin khuopi le khuotate-ah ama zin kawikawi a, Pasien’ manggam tawh kisai lungdamna thu puohin a tangko hi. Sawm le nite zong ama tawh a zawhton vua,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />hla gilote’ mat a kidamsahte le natna tuomtuom pana kidamsah numei pawlkhat in zong ama a zui uhi. Tuate pen: A sung pana dawi sagi a pusuona Magdalene kici Mary,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />tuale Herod inn sung vaihawmpa Chuza’ zi Joanna le Susanna-te a kipanin a neisa utawh amate a panpi numei dang tampite zong ahi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Khuo khat zaw khuo khat panin ama kungah ang pei vua, mi honpi ang kikhop uh ciengin ama in thugentena khat a gen hi:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />“Khaici vawpa khat khaitu dingin kuon a, khai a tu leh pawlkhat lam dungah tu ahi ziehin mite in keng tawh tuonin, vana a leng vate in tungin a netum uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Pawlkhatte suong tungah tu hi; tuale leinom a op lo ziehin a po vangin a gawpmang hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Pawlkhatte ling lahah tu a, ling tawh a khanton ziehin ling in a depgawp hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Pawlkhatte ahile lei hoina-ah tu-in khanglien a, a za zakhatin a pung hi,” a ci hi. Tami thu a gen zaw ciengin, “Zah nading bil a nei tapo in za taheh,” ci-in a kiko hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tua ciengin a nuazuite in tam thugentena’ deina bang ahei, ci-in ama a dong uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Ama in, “A ki-im Pasien’ manggam thute na thei nadingun note tungah tuate ang kipie zo hi. Ahi vangin, ‘Amate in mu napi a mu cien lo nading, za napi a telcien lo nadingun, keima in amate tungah thu ka gen hi,’ a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Thugentena’ khietna tam bang ahi hi: Khaici pen Pasien’ thu ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Lamdunga kiete pen Pasien’ thu a zasate a cinopna ahi hi; tua ciengin amate in umin a kihutdam lo nadingin dawimangpa pei-in a lungtang panun Pasien’ thu a lahpieh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Suong tunga a kiete pen Pasien’ thu a zah ciengun kipah tahin a sang uhi; ahi vangin zung hla loin bakhat sung beh umin, ze-etna hun a tun ciengin a puate ahi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Ling lahah a kiete pen Pasien’ thu za napi leitung lunghimawna, hau nopna le nopsahnate in depgawpin a ga picing zo lote ahi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Lei hoina munah a kiete ahile Pasien’ thu za-in citahna le lungsim pha tawh pomdetin thuohzawhna tawh a ga khiete ahi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />“Koima in meivah a tan zaw ciengin law a khu sih a, lupna nei lah po-ah zong koi loin, a lut mite in khuovah a mu thei nadingin meivah tunna tungah a koizaw uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Azieh pen a kilang lo dinga a kiphuoldap bangma a om sih a, tua ma bangin khuovah in tan a, a kithei lo ding thusim bangma a om sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tua ciengin bangci bangin thu ka ngai ahei ci limtahin kingaisun un; azieh pen a neite kipiehbe hi; tuale a nei lote tung panin a neisa-a a ngaisutte nangawn uh kilahpieh ding hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tua ciengin ama kungah a nu le a sanggamte a pei vua, mi a tam seng ziehin ama kung a tung zo sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tua bepin, “Nang ang mu nuomin a pulamah na nu le na sanggamte a ding uhi,” ci-in ama kungah kigen hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Ahi vangin Jesu in amate kungah, “Pasien’ thu za a, a zui tapo ka nu le ka sanggamte ahi uhi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Ni khat a nuazuite tawh gunkuong tungah tuong a, tuale amate kungah, “Tuili galkhatah galkai vai,” a ci hi. Tuaci’n amate a pei vua,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />gunkuong tawh a pei laitahun ama a kimu hi. Tuipi tungah hui le guo kithuo-in gunkuong sungah tui dim ahi ziehin a zauhuoi dinmunah a om uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Ama kungah amate pei-in a phong vua, “Mangpa, Mangpa, a si sieng ding hi tai!,” ci-in a kiko uhi. Tuale ama zong tho-in huipi le tuihuolpite a hosie hi; tuate khawlin a dai dide pai hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Ama in amate kungah, “Na upna uh hei-ah a om ta ahei?” a ci hi. Amate zau kawm le lamdangsa kawmin, “Tua ahile huipi le tuipite nangawn in a thu a man valia nadingin tampa koi hi mawh ahei?” ci-in khatlekhat a kiho uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Tua ciengin Galilee gam galkhat lama a om Gerasenes gam a tung uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Lei lahah ama a kumsuh laitahin tua khuo-a dawivei mi khat in na dawntuo pai hi. Tuapa in sawtveipi sung puon sil lo in, inn ah zong om loin han lah po-ah a teng hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Ama in Jesu a mu bepin a mai-ah bawhsuhin, “Sangpen Pasien’ Tapa Jesu aw, kei bang ei law sawm na hei? Nei bawlsiet lo nadingin kang thum hi,” ci-in a aw nei za tawh a kiko hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Tam banga a kikona pen tua mipa sung panin hlabua a peikhiet nadingin Jesu in thu a pieh zieh ahi hi. (Azieh pen hlabua in tua mipa tamveipi tah man zo a, siakhau le siakol tawh kihenin a kicin vangin a kikhinate botsan a, tua dawi in ama gamlahah a delmang hi.)
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Tua ciengin Jesu in ama kungah, “Na min bang ahei? ci-in dong hi. Ama in, “Tampi,” a ci hi; azieh pen ama sungah dawi tampi a lut zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Taw nei lo leihawm thuhpi sungah a peikia dingin amate thu a pieh lo nadingin ama kungah a thum uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Tua laitahin muolpang a kikhawi vohhon tampi a om hi; tuale vohte sungah a lut thei nadingun dawite in Jesu kungah a thum vua, ama in zong a phal hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Tua ciengin tuapa sung panin dawite pusuohin vohte sungah a lut uhi; tuale kentawng-ah vohte kumsuhin tuili sungah a kie sieng uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Vohcingte in a thupieng teng a mu ciengun tai-in khuopi le tua gam sung tengah a gen uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Tua ciengin bang thu pieng ahei, ci-in a en dingin mite a pei vua, Jesu kung a tun ciengun Jesu keng phungah dawite taikhietna mipa na to a, ama in puon silin a lungsim a pilkia a mu ciengun a zau uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />A mu masate in amate kungah dawiveipa bangci bangin dam ahei ci thu a gen sawn uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Tua ciengin Gerasenes kimvela mi zosie a zau seng ziehun amate a peisan nadingin Jesu kungah a thum uhi; tuaci’n Jesu zong gunkuong tungah tuongin a kilekia hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Dawite a peikhietna pa in ama tawh a zawton nadingin a thum hi; ahi vangin Jesu in ama kungah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />“Na inn ah kilekia zaw inlen, Pasien in nang dingin bangza tahin ang seppieh ahei, ci thute va gen ta’n,” ci-in a sawl hi. Tuaci’n ama pei a, khuopi sung tengah Jesu in bangza tahin ama adingin bawlpieh ahei, ci thute a phuongzah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Tuale mihonpite in ama lamen uh ahi ziehin, Jesu a kilekia ciengin amate in a na dawn uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />Tua laitahin Jairus a kici kikhopna inn uhpa khat tua munah pei a, Jesu’ keng phungah bawhin ama’ inn ah a haw nadingin a thum hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />Bangzieh ahei cile ama in kum sawm le kum ni bang a pha tanu khat beh nei a, tua nu cina-in si dihtah hi. Ama a pei laitahin a kimvelah mipite a kiphul valuh uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" />Khum hun laitahin kum sawm le kum ni sung siluong natna a vei numei khat a om hi; tuale sievuonte cielna-in a neisa zosie a zah sieng vangin koima in ama damsah zo lo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" />Jesu’ nua lamah ama nu pei-in a puonmongtep a tham ciengin thakhatthu-in a siluong natna a khawl pai hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" />Tua ciengin Jesu in, “Ei tham koi ahei?” ci-in dong a, amate in a unpi vua a niel ciengun Peter in, “Mangpa, na kimkotah mihonpi in ang neh valuh vua, ang phuhkhah uh hi lel bo va,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" />Ahi vangin Jesu in, “Mi khat in ei tham hi; a zieh pen ka tung panin vanglietna a peikhiet lam ka thei hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" />Tua numei nu in a kisel zo lo ding lam a thei bepin zau-in a citunsa-in pei a, Jesu mai-ah bawhsuhin mipi zosiete mai-ah ama a thamna le a tham cienga thakhata a dampaina thu a gen hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" />Jesu in tua nu kungah, “Ka tanu aw, na upna in nang ang damsah zo ta hi; lungmuong tahin pei ta’n,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" />Ama in thu a gen laitahin makaipa inn panin mi khat pei a, “Na tanu si ta; siepa buoisah nawn da in,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" />Jesu in tam thu a zah ciengin, “Zau sinlen um beh lel in, ama nu ang hingkia ding hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" />Inn sung a tun ciengin ama in Peter, John, James le naupang’ nu le pa simlo, ama tawh inn sunga tum ding koima dang a phal sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" />Amate a unpi-un kap le mau-in a na om uhi; ahi vangin ama in, “Kap sih un; azieh pen ama a si ahi sih a, a kimu ahi bo hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" />Ama nu a si zo lam amate in a thei ziehun Jesu a nuisan uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" />Ahi vangin ama in a khut tawh tua nu tu-in, “Numeino aw, tho vawi!” ci-in hlan hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="55" style="v" />Tua nu’ hlagau hingkia a, thakhatthu-in a thoto pai hi. Tua ciengin Jesu in a neh ding bangkhat pie un, ci-in a sawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="56" style="v" />A nu le a pa in lamdang a sa uhi; ahi vangin ama in a piengsa thute koima kunga a gen lo nadingun amate thu a pie hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="9" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tua ciengin Jesu in a nuazui sawm le nite hlanin dawite zosie a hawlkhiet nading ule natnate a damsah thei nading uh thuneina le vanglietna pie a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Pasien’ manggam thu a tangko ding le cinate a damsah dingin amate a sawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Ama in amate kungah, “Na khuolzinna vua na zah dingun ciengkhut, thung-ip, anphel, le sum cite keng sih unlen, puon-ah nangawn zong a valin kenbe sih un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Na lutna uh inn khat popo-ah om peisuoh unlen tua inn pan ma-in dingkhie un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Zin ang tungsah lo khuo khat popo panin na pei ding ciengun amate langah teci ahi dingin na keng vua leivuite thing dawh un,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Amate zong kuonin khuo zosie-ah a pei vua, lungdamna thu tangko-in muncin tengah cinate a damsah uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Gam uhpa Herod in thupieng zosie a zah ciengin a buoi mama hi, azieh pen mi pawlkhat in sina panin John thokia zo hi, a ci vua,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />pawlkhat in Elijah ang kilang hi, ci-in, pawlkhat leuleu in tanglai kamsangte khat ang thokia hi, a ci uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Herod in, “John’ ngawng ka tansansa ahi hi; tam banga a thu ka zah pa koi ahei?” a ci hi. Tuale ama a mu nadingin a hanciem hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />A khuolzinna uh panin a kile lamun sawltahpite in Jesu kungah a nasepna teng a gen uhi. Ama in amate zawpi-in Bethsaida kici khuo khatah a peidap uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Mihonte in tam thu a thei ciengun ama a zui uhi; ama in zong amate na muoh a, amate kungah Pasien’ manggam thu genin cidam nading deite a damsah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Ni a tum kuon ciengin sawm le nite pei-in ama kungah, “Gamsip-a om i hi ziehun gie nading le neh ding a sui dingin tam kim a khuotate le gamte-ah mipi peisah in,” a ci uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Ahi vangin ama in, “A neh ding uh bang khat popo pie un,” a ci hi. Amate in, “Tami mi zosie adingin an lei dinga pei ding ka hi ngal sih uleh anlum nga le nga tawn ni simlo bangma a val ka nei sih uhi,” a ci uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Azieh pen khum munah pasal tul nga bang a om hi. Tuale ama in a nuazuite kungah, “Mi sawm nga ta-in a pawlpawlin tosah un,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Amate in tua ma bangin a unpi-un a tosah uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Ama in anlum nga le ngasa tawn ni la a, vantung lam ento-in lungdam a ko zaw ciengin phalsuo a, mihonpi mai-a lui dingin a nuazuite a pie hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Mi zosie in ne-in a kham ciet uhi. Tuale khamval teng a khawm uleh seu sawm le seu ni a pha hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Khatvei, Jesu ama guoh thungenin a op laitahin a nuazuite zong a gei-ah a om uhi, tuale amate kungah, “Mihonpite in kei koi hi, ei ci vuoi?” ci-in a dong hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Amate in, “Baptize-pa John hi; adang pawlkhat in, Elijah hi; pawlkhatte leuleu in tanglai kamsangte khat ang thokia hi, ang ci uhi,” ci-in a dawng uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Ama in amate kungah, “Tua ahile note in lah kei koi hi, nei ci vuoi?” a ci hi. Peter in, “Nang pen Pasien’ Messiah na hi hi,” ci-in a dawng hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Ama in koima kungah a gen lo nadingun khautahin amate thupie a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />“Mihing Tapa in gimna lienpi thuohin upate, siempu liente le thukham hil siete in a niel ding vua, tuale ama kithatin ni thum ni-in a thokia ding hi,” ci-in a gen hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Tua ciengin Jesu in amate zosie kungah, “Mi khatpo ka nuazui a suo nop leh ama le ama kinielin, nisimin a singlamte puo-in ka nua ei zui taheh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Azieh pen a hinna a hu nuom tapo in a tan ding vua, keima zieha a hinna a tan tapo in a hinna a hudawh ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Mi khat in leitung buppi a nga vangin a hinna tanin suplaw leh bang phattuomna om ding ahei?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Keima le ka thu ei zumpite, mihing Tapa in ama’ minthanna, a Pa’ minthanna le vantung misiengthote’ minthanna tawh ang pei ciengin tuapa a zumpi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Ahi vangin a tahtah a kang ci-in, tam sunga a ding mi pawlkhat in Pasien’ manggam a mu masangin sina a ciem sih ding uhi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Tam thu teng a gen zaw a ni gietna pawlin ama in Peter, John le James-te zawpi-in thungen dingin muol tungah a peito uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Thu a nget laitahin a mel kikhel a, a puon zong a vam lihleh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Amate in thakhatthu-in mihing ni, Moses le Elijah, tawh ama a kiho a mu uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Amate minthanna tawh a kilang vua, Jerusalem ah Jesu a si nading vai teng a tangtun zawh nading thu a kikum uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Tua laitahin Peter le a ompite kimut suohin a lusu uhi; ahi vangin amate a khahlaw ciengun ama’ minthanna le ama tawh a dington mihing ni a mu uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Tua mihing nite in ama a nuasie kuonun Peter in bang gen ka hei ci zong a thei lo pi-in Jesu kungah, “Mangpa, tami munah i om pen nuom mama hi; nangma ading buh khat, Moses ading buh khat le Elijah ading buh khat, buh thum ei lamsah in,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Tami thu a gen laitahin meiilom khat kai-in amate a liemang hi; meiilum lahah a op ziehun amate a zau mama uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Tua ciengin meiilum lah panin aw khat in, “Tampa pen ka Teelsa ka Tapa ahi hi; ama’ thu na ngai un!” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Tua awging in thu a gen zaw ciengin Jesu ama guohin a om hi. Amate in tua sawng tengin a musa uh thute koima kungah gen lo-in a dai khipkhep uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />A zing ni, muoltung panin a kumsuh zaw ciengun, mihonpi in ama a na dawntuo uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Tua zaw a sawt loin mihonpi lah panin pasal khat kiko a, “Siepa aw, ka tapa nei et pieh dingin kang thum hi; ama beh tapa-a ka nei ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Hlagau khat in ama man a, thakhatthu-in a peng vagua hi. Dawi in a kam sungah a cilphuon a kai dongin kongkaw sahin liemsah gawp a, a hla nuom zepzep sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Na nuazuite kungah tua dawi ei hawlkhietpieh nadingun ka thum vangin a hawlkhie zo sih uhi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />Jesu in, “Upna nei lo, a letat khang mite aw, bang tanvei note hing ompi-in hing thuoh zo lai ding ka hei? Tam munah na tapa hing peipi in,” ci-in a dawng hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />Naupang pa a pei laitahin dawi in lei lahah lawmlia-in a kongkawsah gawp hi. Ahi vangin Jesu in tua hlabua hosie a, naupang damsahin a pa a apkia hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" />Tuaci’n a unpi-un Pasien’ vanglietna mu-in lamdang a sa mama uhi. Mi zosie in a sil bawl teng vannuoi lamdangsa-in a op laitahun ama in a nuazuite kungah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" />“Tam thute na bil vuah lutsah un: Mite khut sungah Mihing Tapa a ki-ap ding ahi ta hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" />Ahi vangin amate in tami a kigen thu a tel siem sih uhi; amau’ thei lo dinga tam thu a ki-imdap ahi ziehin, amate in a khietna a tel thei sih vua, a kigen thu tawh kisai zong ama a dong ngam sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" />Amate lahah koi lienpen ahei, ci thu tawh kisai-in kiselna a om hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" />Ahi vangin Jesu in a lungsim vua a ngaisutna uh a thei ciengin naupang khat kai-in a gei-ah koi a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" />amate kungah, “Ka min tawh tami naupang a sang mi poma in kei ei sang ahi a, kei ei sang poma in kei ei sawlpa zong a sang ahi hi; azieh pen note lahah a neupen pa khu a lienpen pa ahi hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" />John in, “Mangpa, nangma’ min tawh dawi a hawlkhie mi khat ka mu vua, ama in eite ei zui lo ahi ziehin ka kham uhi, ci-in a dawng hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" />Ahi vangin Jesu in ama kungah, “Ama kham sih un; azieh pen no ang langpan lo poma no lam a pang ahi hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" />A kilahto ding hun a nai ciengin ama in Jerusalem lam pei ding mitsuon in a nei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" />A masangah kamtaite sawl a, amate in lamkalah Jesu ading nate a baisa-a a koipieh dingin Samaria khuo khatah a lut uhi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" />ahi vangin Jesu in Jerusalem lam manaw sawm ahi ziehin amate in ama a na dawn sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" />A nuazui James le John-te in a thei uh ciengin amate in, “ Topa aw, vantung panin meikuong kiesah suhin amate katumsah uleng nei awi ei mah?” a ci uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="55" style="v" />Ahi vangin Jesu kihei-in amate a phawhsie hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="56" style="v" />Tua ciengin khuo dang khatah a peisuoh uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" />Lampi-ah amate a pei laitahun mi khat in ama kungah, “Na peipei na-ah kang zui ding hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="58" style="v" />Tuale Jesu in tuapa kungah, “Ngiete in kuo nei-in, vana leng vate in zong bu a nei vua, hizongle Mihing Tapa in a lu ngah nading mun nei lo hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="59" style="v" />Ama in adang khat kungah, “Ei zui in,” a ci hi. Ahi vangin tuapa in, “ Topa aw, pei-in ka pa va vui phot ta vang,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="60" style="v" />Ahi vangin Jesu in tua pa kungah, “Misite in a misite uh vuisah lel in; nang na hile va pei inlen Pasien’ manggam thu va tangko zaw ta’n,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="61" style="v" />Midang khat in zong, “ Topa nang hing zui vang; ahi vangin ka inn-ate mangpha va pai phot ta vang,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="62" style="v" />Jesu in tuapa kungah, “A lokaina tu kawmin a nualam en pa pen Pasien’ manggam tawh kituoh lo hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="10" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tua zaw ciengin Topa in a pei nading khuo le khuopi zosie-ah mi nita-a a pei nadingin adang sawm sagite se a, ama mai-ah a mapeisah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Ama in amate kungah, “Anlah ding tam mama a, hinanle nasem mi a tawm hi; tua ahi ziehin a lo lai-ah anla ding nasemte ang sawl nadingin an nei Topa kungah thungen un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Na lampi vuah pei unlen, ngiehon lahah tuunote a kihla bangin note kang sawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Sum-ip, thung-ip le kedapte keng sih un; lampi-ah koima hopi sih un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Inn khat popo-ah na lut ciengun, ‘Tami inn sungah lungmuonna om taheh!’ ci masa un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tua sungah lungmuonna dei a op leh, tua mipa tungah na pieh uh lungmuonna tung ding a, ahi vangin a dei mi a op sih leh na kung vuah ang kinuale kia ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Inn khatah tamsuoh unlen amate ang pieh bangbang ne-in dawn un, azieh pen nasem mi in thaman a nga ding kilawm hi. Inn khat pan inn khat kituon kawikawi sih un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Khuo khat po-ah na lut ciengun a mite in zin ang tunsah leh na mai vua ang kilui bangbang ne un;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />cinate damsah unlen amate kungah, ‘Note kungah Pasien’ manggam ang tung kuon ta hi,’ ci-in gen un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Ahi vangin khuo khat popo-ah na lut uh ciengin zin ang tunsah sih leh a khuo sung lampite-ah pei unlen,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />‘Kang elsietna-un na khuo sung vua leivui, ka keng vua ang bangte nangawn zong ka thingkhie uhi. Hizongle tami thei un: Pasien’ manggam ang tung kuon ta hi,’ ci-in gen un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Ke’n kang ci-in, khum ni ciengin Sodom khuopi’ thuoh ding sangin tua khuopi’ thuoh ding hahsazaw ding hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />“Chorazin aw, gimna na thuoh ding hi! Bethsaida aw, gimna na thuoh ding hi! Bangzieh ahei cile note gel tunga kibawl vanglien nasepnate, Tyre khuo le Sidon khuo sunga kibawl hi poma leh sawtpi lai-in a mawna uh kisiakia-in la-ip puon silin, vut kibuohin om zo tham ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Ahi vangin thukhen ni cienga na thuoh ding uh gimna sangin Tyre le Sidon-te’ thuohna nuomzaw tham ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Nang Capernaum aw, vantung dongin ang kitawisang ding amah? Hi lo hi, Misikhuo dongah ang kikhiesuh ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />“Na thu uh a ngai poma kei thu ngai ahi a, no ang pampaih poma kei ei pampaih ahi hi; kei ei pampai poma kei ei sawlpa zong a pampai ahi hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Sawm sagite lungdamin a kilekia vua, “ Topa aw, na min ziehin dawite nangawn in ka thu uh mang hi!” a ci uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Ama in amate kungah, “Keima in vantung panin keh kie bangin Satan ang kiehsuh ka mu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />En un, gulte, mom-aite na totcil nading ule na galpa’ vanglietna zosie na zaw nadingun note tungah thuneina kang pie zo hi; bangma in note ang liemsah sih ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Hizongle dawite in na thu uh a man ziehin lungdam sih unlen, tua sangin vantungah na min uh a kigiel ziehin lungdamzaw un,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Khum hun lien ma-in Hlagau Siengtho sungah Jesu lungdam a, “Vantung le leitung’ Topa ahi ka Pa aw, nangma in mipilte le misiemte kungah tam thute imcipin naupangte tungah na lah ziehin na tungah ka lung a dam hi; hima hi, Pa aw, tam pen a lungkimhuoi nangma’ deina ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Ka pa in kei tungah na zosie ei ap zo a, Tapa koi ahei, ci Pa longal koima in thei lo a, Pa koi ahei, ci zong Tapa le Tapa in ama tunga a hil mi khatpo longal koima in thei lo hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Tua ciengin a nuazuite lamah kihei-in amate kungah, “Na sil mute uh a mu na mit uh a hampha ahi hi!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Bangzieh ahei cile kamsang tampite le kumpi tampite in na sil mute uh a mu nop vangun a na mu sih vua, na zah uh thute a zah nop vangun a na za kha sih uhi,” ci-in a gendap hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Tua zaw a sawt loin Jesu zelah dingin thukham hil siepa khat dingto a, “Siepa aw, kumtawn hinna ka nga thei nadingin bang bawl ding ka hei?” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Ama in tuapa kungah, “Thukham sungah bang a kigiel ei? Tua sungah bang pen na sim ei?” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Ama in, “ Topa na Pasien, na lungtang zosie, na hla zosie, na hatna zosie le na ngaisutna zosie-te tawh na it ding a, nang le nang na ki-it bangin na vengpa zong na it ding hi,” ci-in a dawng hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Tuale Jesu in, “Nei dawnna man hi; tam bangin gam ta in, tua hile na hing ding hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Ahi vangin tuapa ama le ama kidihsah nuom ahi ziehin Jesu kungah, “Ka vengpa koi ahei?” ci-in dong hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Jesu in, “Jerusalem panin Jericho lamah mi khat a peisuh laitahin misuomte’ khut sung a tung kha hi. Amate in tua mipa’ puon a hawdawhpieh vua, ama sat gawpin a sikhielin a nuasie uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Tua laitahin upmaw lopi-in tua lampi zui-in siempu khat peisuh a, ama a mu ciengin lam gei-ah pielin a nawtsuoh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Tua ma bangin Levi mi khat tua munah a pei ciengin tuapa mu a, ama in zong lam gei-ah pielin a nawtsuoh leuleu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Ahi vangin Samaria-te khat a khuolzin laitahin tuapa gei-ah a tung hi; ama in tua mipa a mu ciengin khuotuo a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />ama kungah pei-in a liemnate sathau le lenggazu a nu zaw ciengin a tunpieh hi. Tua ciengin a gan tungah tua pa tuongsah a, zintun inn khatah puohin kem hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />A zing ciengin ama in zintun inn cingpa kungah sum denarii ni pie-in, ‘Tampa hoitahin na kem in; na zahbe a op leh kang kilekia ciengin kang lokia ding hi,’ ci-in a gen hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Tam teng thum sungah a kisuompa adingin koi pen a vengpa hi, ci-in na ngaisun ei?” ci-in dong hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Ama in, “Tua mipa tunga khuotuona lah pa hi ven,” a ci hi. Jesu in tuapa kungah, “Pei inlen tam bangin bawl in,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />A lampi vuah amate a pei laitahun khuo khatah Jesu baang a, tua munah Martha kici numei khat in a inn ah a tungsah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Tua nu in Mary kici nau numei khat nei a, Topa’ keng phungah ama to-in a thugente a ngai hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Ahi vangin Martha pen nasep a kitahla mama hi. Tuaci’n Jesu kungah pei-in, “ Topa aw, ka naunu in nasep zosie kei matanga ei sepsah phamaw na sa sih amah? Kei ei hu nadingin gen in,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />Jesu in Martha kungah, “Martha aw, nang in lunghimawna na hau a, na lungsim a buoi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />A kisam na khat beh a om hi. Mary in ama kung panin a kilahpieh lo ding a hoizaw pen a teel zo ta hi,” ci-in a dawng hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="11" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Khatvei ama in mun khatah thungen a, a man ciengin a nuazuite lahah khat in, “ Topa , John in a nuazuite thunget dan ding a hil bangin ko zong ei hil in,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Ama in amate kungah, “Thu na nget ciengun tam bangin na ngen un: Pa aw, na min siengtho kizatat taheh. Na gam hing tung taheh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Nisim ka neh ding uh an ei pie in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Ko tunga ang mawte ka maisah bangun ka mawnate uh ei maisah in. Solna ei thuohsah sin,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Ama in amate kungh, “Note lahah khat in lawm khat nei-in zankim laitahin ama kungah pei-in, ‘Lawm aw, anlum thum ei leitawi in;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />azieh pen ka lawmpa khat a khuolzinna panin ang tung a, a mai-a lui ding bangma ka nei sih hi,’ a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tuaci’n inn sung panin ama in, “Ei buoisah sin; kot ka khah zo ta vua, ka tate tawh ka lum zo ta uhi; kei hing tho-in bangma kang pie thei sih hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Ke’n kang ci-in, tuapa a lawmpa ahi ziehin ama tho-in bangma khat nangawn a pieh lo vangin a nget paupau ziehin ama tho-in a kisap teng pie veve ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />“Tuaci’n ke’n kang ci-in, ngen un, ang kipie ding hi; sui un, na mu ding uhi; kiu un, kot ang kihon ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Bangzieh ahei cile a ngen tapo in nga a, a sui tapo in mu-in, a kiu tapo kot kihon ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Note lahah na tapa un nga ngen leh tuami tangin gul a pie ding koi om na hi uh ahei?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Ahi sihle na tapa un aatui ngen leh mom-ai na pie ding uh amah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tua ahile no migilote in na tate uh na hoi pieh dan ding thei na hi uleh tua sangin vanah a om na Pa un ama kunga a ngen mite tungah Hlagau Siengtho a pie zaw kan sih ding amah!” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Khatvei Jesu in a ham thei lo dawi khat a deldawh hi; tua dawi a pusuo ciengin a ham thei lo mipa ham thei pai a, mihonpi in lamdang a sa mama uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Ahi vangin amate lahah mi pawlkhat in, “Dawite’ mangpa Beelzebul’ min tawh dawite a deldawh hi bo,” a ci uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Pawlkhatte leuleu in a ze-etna-un vantung panin lim khat a ngen uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Ahi vangin Jesu in a ngaisutna uh thei a, amate kungh, “Ama le ama kido a, a kikhenkeh gam khat popo mangthai ding a, innkuon khat zong a sunga om mite a kikhenkeh leh a pua ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Satan zong ama le ama kido-in kikhenkeh leh a gam bangci kip thei ding ahei? Bang ding ahei cile note in Beelzebul suonga dawite a deldawh hi bo nei ci uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Beelzebul suonga dawite deldawh ka hi leh dawi hawlkhie theite in koi’ min suonga a deldawh uh ahei? Tua ahi ziehin amate pen na tung vua thukhente ahi ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Hizongle dawite ka hawlkhietna pen Pasien’ khutme hang tawh ahile note tungah Pasien’ manggam ang tung zo ahi ta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Mi thahat khat in galhiem bukim tawh a inn a cin ciengin a neisate bihtahin a om hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Ahi vangin ama sanga a thahatzaw mi khat in ama bulu-in a zawgawp ciengin ama’ muon a galhiemte lahpiehin a vanlah teng a hawmthang hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Kei ei panpi lo poma kei ei do hi a, kei ei khoppi lo poma a thethang ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />“Mi khat sung panin hlabua a pusuo zaw ciengin, khawl nading mun sui dingin tui op lona gamte-ah vah kawikawi a, a mu zawh lo ciengin ama in, ‘Ka peikhietna inn ma-ah kilekia vang,’ a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Ama a tun ciengin tua inn na kiphiet siengin a kipuo sinsenin a op a mu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Tua ciengin ama pei-in ama sanga a gilozaw hlagau dang sagi zawpi a, tua inn ah lutin a teng uhi; tua mipa pienzie pen a masa lai sangin siehuoizaw hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Ama in tami thu a gen laitahin mipi lahah numei khat kiko a, “Ang paai gil le na tawp nawi pen thupha nga ahi hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Ahi vangin ama in, “Pasien’ thu za-a a zui mite hampha zaw uhi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Mihonte a tam semsem ciengin ama thugen kipan a, “Tam khang mite pen a gilo khang mite ahi uhi; amate in lim khat a ngen uhi, ahi vangin Jonah lim longal bangma lim kipie lo ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Nineveh khuomite adingin Jonah pen lim khat ahi ma bangin mihing Tapa zong tami khang mite adingin lim khat hi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Thukhen ni ciengin leitaw lam gam pana ang pei kumpinu in tami khang mite langkhatah dingin a mawsah ding hi, azieh pen Solomon pilna thu ngai dingin leimong khat panin ama a kuon hi, en in tam sungah Solomon sanga a lienzaw khat a om hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Thukhen ni ciengin tami khang mite langkhatah Nineveh khuomite dingin a mawsah ding uhi, azieh pen Jonah’ thugenna ziehin amate a kisiakia uhi, en in, tam sungah Jonah sanga a lienzaw mi khat a om hi, a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />“Koima in meivah a vah zaw ciengin mun kawmah koi loin a sunga lut mite in khuovah a mu thei nadingin meivah tunna tungah koizaw hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Na mit pen na pumpi adingin meivah ahi hi. Na mit uh a ciim leh na pumpi uh khuovah tawh kidim ding a, na mit uh a hoi sih leh na pumpi uzong khuomiel tawh kidim ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Tua ahi ziehin na sung vua om khuovah a miel lo nadingin pilvang un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Tua ciengin na pumpi zosie uh khuovah tawh kidim a, a mielna mun khat zong a op sih leh, khuovah in note ang tanvah ma bangin na pumpi uh ang tangkim ding hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Thu a gen laitahin Pharisee-te khat in ama an nehpi dingin hlan a, tuaci’n ama zong pei-in an ne dingin sabuoi ah a to hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Ama in khut sil masa loin an a neh lam Pharisee pa in a mu bepin lamdangsa mama hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Tua ciengin Topa in ama kungah, “No Pharisee-te in hai le kuongte a pulam na nawt sieng zemzom vua, ahi vangin na sung lam uh huoihamna le gitlona tawh a kidim hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />No mimaw lawmte! a pulam a bawlpa in a sunglam zong bawl hi lo amah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />Tuaci’n a sung lama om nate mizawngte na pie un; tua hile note adingin na zosie a siengtho ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />“No Pharisee-te in gimna na thuoh ding uhi! Azieh pen note in masala, lengmusel le ante lohing namkim tungah sawm-ah-khat na pie vua, ahi vangin thutang le Pasien itna na don vanuh sih uhi; adangte zong nelsie tuon loin tamte na bawl ding uh ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" />No Pharisee-te in gimna na thuoh ding uhi! Bangzieh ahei cile kikhopna inn sungah topha nuompen na dei vua, vanzuana munte-ah zatah hopi ding na dei uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" />Note in gimna na thuoh ding uhi! Azieh pen mite in a thei lo ziehun a tungah lamhlahna-a a nei uh, ciemtena a om lo hankhuhte tawh na kibang uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" />Thukham hil siete lahah khat in, “Siepa, tam bang na gen ciengin ko zong ei gensie na hi hi,” ci-in a dawng hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" />Tuale ama in, “No thukham hil siete in zong gimna na thuoh ding uhi! Azieh pen mi puoh zawh lo ding vangih na suon vua, tua van a puohpi dingin note in lah na khutme uzong na lamto nuom sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" />Note in gimna na thuoh ding uhi! Azieh pen na pu na pate un a na tha kamsangte’ han na lampieh uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" />Tuaci’n note na hi ule na pu na pate uh’ gamtatnate a thukimpi, a tecite na hi uhi; bangzieh ahei cile amate in kamsangte a na that vua, note in amau’ han na lampieh uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" />Tua ahi ziehin Pasien’ pilna laibu in zong, ‘Amate kungah kamsangte le sawltahpite ka sawl ding a, amate in tua mite pawlkhat bawlsie-in that ding uhi,’ a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" />Tuaci’n amate in leitung piencil a kipanin a na luonsah uh kamsang zosiete’ sisan,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" />Abel’ sisan a kipanin maitam le mun siengtho kikala a na tha uh Zechariah’ sisan dong, tami khang mite tungah ka phulkia ding hi. Ahi hi, ke’n kang ci-in, tami khang mite tungah ka phulkia ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" />No thukham hil siete in gimna na thuoh ding uhi! Azieh pen note in theina tawhtang na ladawh vua, note lah lut loin a lut dingte lah na khahtan vanuh uhi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" />A pulamah ama a pei ciengin thukham hil siete le Pharisee-te in langbawl kipanin thukhel tampitah a dong vua,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" />a kamham tung panin mawmat ding sui-in a buhdap uhi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="12" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Khatlekhat a kituoncil za dongin mihon tul tampite kikhawmin a op laitahun ama in a nuazuite kungah thugen masa a, “Kineitawmna ahi Pharisee-te’ tol kidawm un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />A kilang lo dinga a ki tuomcip bangma a om sih a, a kithei lo dinga a kiphuoldap bangma a om sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tua ahi ziehin khuomiel lahah na gen popo uh khuovah sungah kiza ding a, inn sungtawnga na kidaphona popo uh inn khumvum ah kitangko ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Lawmte aw, ke’n kang ci-in, pumpi a thazaw uh ciengin tua ban bangma a law thei lote na giing sih un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Na giin ding uh koi ahei ci kang hil ding hi: Pumpi a tha zaw ciengin hell khuh sunga khieh thei nading thuneina a neipa giingzaw un. Ahi hi, ke’n kang ci-in, tua pa na giing un!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Vato nga ciengin dangkasan peh ni tawh kizua lel hi lo amah? Hinanle Pasien mai-ah tuate khat nangawn kimangngil lo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Ahi vangin na lu tung vua na samzamte nangawn uh a kisim siengsa ahi hi. Zau sih un; vato tampi sangin na manpha zaw uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />“Ke’n kang ci-in, midangte mai-a keima ei sang poma, mihing Tapa in zong Pasien vantung mite mai-ah a sang ding hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />ahi vangin mi dangte mai-a kei ei nuol poma, Pasien’ vantung mite mai-ah kinuol ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Mihing Tapa langpangain thu gen poma kimaisah ding a, hizongle Hlagau Siengtho a gensie poma kimaisah lo ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Amate in kikhopna innte-ah hile, vaihawmte le thuneite mai-ah hile ang peipi ciengun bangci kihutin bang thu gen ding ka hei ci-in lunghimaw sih un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Azieh pen, tua hun ciengin Hlagau Siengtho in na gen ding uh ang hil ding hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Mihonpi lah panin khat in ama kungah, “Siepa, ka sanggampa in gamh ei hop nading in ei genpieh in,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Ahi vangin Jesu in tuapa kungah, “Lawm aw, nogel tunga thukhen ding le gamh hawmpieh dingin kei koi in ei se ahei? a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tuale ama in amate kungah, “Pilvang un! Huoihamna zosie panin na kikem un; azieh pen hau le dipna sungah mihing hinna om lo hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tua ciengin ama in amate kungah thugentena khat a gen hi: “Mihaupa khat’ lo-ah an tampi a pieng hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tuale ama in, ‘Ka ankhol nading mun nei lo ka hi ziehin bang law ding ka hei,’ ci-in a lungsim sungah ngaisun hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tua ciengin ama in, ‘Tam bangin ka bawl ding hi: Ka ansaal phelin a golzaw khat ka lam ding a, tua sungah ka antang le ka van teng ka khol ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tuale ka hlagau kungah, “Ka hlagau aw, kum tampi khom ding van tampi na khol zo hi; ne-in dawn inlen, guolnuomin om hit hiet in, ka ci ding hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Ahi vangin Pasien in tuapa kungah, “Nang mimawpa! Tuzan mama-in na hinna kila ta ding hi. Tuale na kholsa nate koi-a’ ahi ta diei?’ a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Tuaci’n amau adinga gou a kholte pen Pasien lamah mihau ahi sih hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Ama in a nuazuite kungah, “Tua ahi ziehin ke’n kang ci-in, hinkhuo ading bang kine ding a, pumpi tungah bang kisil ding ahei, ci-in lunghimaw sih un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Azieh pen an sangin hinna thupizaw a, puonsil sangin pumpi thupizaw hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Va-ahte ngaituo vawi un: Amate in vaw lah vaw lo, at lah at lo, an kholna inn le ansal zong a nei sih uhi, ahi vangin Pasien in amate a va hi. Vate sangin note nahpi tahin na manphazaw uhi!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Note lahah a lunghimaw ziehin a khankum nai khat sung beh a belap thei koi om na hi uh ahei?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Khum banga sil neuno khat zong bawl thei lo na hi uleh bang dinga adangte lunghimawpi na hi uh ahei?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Unoh paate bangci khan ahei ngaisun un: Tuate in na sem loin vau zong a zom ngai sih uhi; hizongle ke’n kang ci-in, Solomon nangawn a minthanna teng tawh a kizep vangin tua unoh paate lahah khat zong a pha zo sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Ahi vangin Pasien in tuni-in hing a, zing cienga meikhuh sunga a kihaltum ding gamlah lopate puonsil guon ahile ama in bangza tahin note puonsil hing guonzaw sem ding ahei, no upna neute aw!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Tua ahi ziehin na neh na dawn ding uh sui penin nei loin lunghimawpi den mielmuol sih un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Bang ding ahei cile leitung minam zosie in tami nate a sui vua, na Pa un tuate na kisap lam uh a thei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Tuate sangin ama’ manggam suizaw un, tua hile note tungah tami nate ang kipiehbe ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />“Tuuhon tawmnote aw, zau sih un, azieh pen note kang pieh ding kumpi’ gam khu na Pa uh’ lungkimna ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Na neisate uh zua unlen mizawngte pie un. Noma adingin a tul thei lo sum-ip bawl un, gutate in a nai thei lona, nget in zong a suhsiet thei lona mun vantungah a mang thei lo dingin na gougil uh kholzaw un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Azieh pen na gougil opna munah na lungsim uh a om ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Na kawng uh gahin na meivahte uh tangsah un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Mopawi simna panin a kilekia a pu un kot a kiu ciengin thakhatin a hon thei pai dinga a ngah lenlon mite bangin om un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />A pupa uh a pei ciengin a kigingsa-a a mu nasemte mi hampha ahi uhi; a tahtah a kang ci-in, ama in a kawng gahin an ne dingin amate tosah ding a, tuale ama pei-in amate an a lui ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Zankim laitah hile, zingmawng khuovah kuon lam hile a pei hun sunga ama in a mu khah silate mi hampha ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />“Ahi vangin tami thu thei un: Inn neipa in gutate pei ding hun thei leh ama in inn bulusah lo ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Note zong a kigingsa-in om zing un, azieh pen na muonmaw lo laitahun Mihing Tapa ang pei ding hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />Peter in, “ Topa aw, tami thugentena ko dinga na gen amah, ahi sihle mi zosie ading ahei?” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />Tuale Topa in, “Tua ahile a silate uhin, a hunhuna amate an pie dinga a pupa in a koi, a muonhuoi le a pilvang inn sung vaisaipa koi ahei?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" />A pupa a tun ciengin tua banga a sem a mu silapa mi hampha ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" />A tahtah a kang ci-in, ama in a neisa teng zosie a uh dingin tua mipa a koi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" />Ahi vangin tua silapa in a lungsim sungah, “Ka pupa ang tungha lel ding hi,” ci-in sila numeite le pasalte sat gawpin, an ne tui dawnin zu na kham gawp leh,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" />a muonmaw lo ni le a thei khah lo hun laitahin tua silapa’ pupa tung ding a, tuale ama semnenin mi thumanlote tawh a koiton ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" />A pupa’ dei dan thei napi-in, tua banga gamta nuom lo le a kigingkhol nuom lo tua silapa in satna nahpi-in a thuoh ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" />Ahi vangin a pupa’ deina a thei lo ziehin sat dinga kilawm mipa a kitawmsat zawdeu ding hi. Tampi a kipie pa tung panin tampi kikalh ding hi; tuale tampi a ki-ap pa tung panin a tamzaw kingenkia ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" />“Leitungah mei kuong hla dinga ang pei ka hi a, tua mei khu a kuong zo hi taleh ka nuom hi!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" />Ka ki-baptize nading baptize-na khat ka nei a, tuami a kicin masangsie ka lung a nuom thei sih ding hi!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" />Leitungah kilemna puoh dinga ang pei nei sa uh amah? Ka hi sih hi. Ke’n kang ci-in, kikhenna a piengsah dinga ang pei ka hizaw hi!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" />Tu-a kipanin innkuon khat sungah mihing nga a phate, a langah thum, a langah ni-in a kido ding vua, thumte in nite do-in nite in thumte a langpang ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" />Amate pen: A tapa langah a pa, a pa langah a tapa, a tanu langah a nu, a nu langah a tanu, monu langah innpi nu, innpinu langah monu kilangpan cietin, amate a kikhenthang ding uhi,” ci-in a dawng hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" />Ama in mihonpite kungah, “Nitumna lamah meii ang kai na mu ciengun, ‘Guo ang zu ding hi,’ na ci thei pai lien vua, tua bangin a pieng hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="55" style="v" />Tua ma bangin leitaw lam hui ang lan ciengin, ‘Ni sa ding hi,’ na ci uhi; tua bangin a pieng pai hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="56" style="v" />No mihoi kipangte aw, leitung pienzie le vantung pienziete a deina khie-in gen thei napi ucin, bang dingin tuhun thute gen thei lo na hi uh ahei?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" />“Tuale bang dingin thudihte khen thei lo na hi uh ahei?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="58" style="v" />Tua ahi ciengin no ang hehpa tawh thukhenmangpa kungah na peiton laitahun na thu uh a mai thei nadingin lamkalah hanciem un, tua ahi sihle ama in thukhenmangpa kungah hing tutin, thukhen mangpa in vaihawm pa khutah ang tut ding a, vaihawm pa in thong sungah ang khum ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="59" style="v" />Ke’n kang ci-in, na lieu ding uh sum dangkasan na pieh sieng masangsie-un thong sung panin na suohta thei sih ding uhi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="13" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Khum hun laitahin tua sunga om mi pawlkhat in, Pilat in Galilee-te’ sisan le amau’ biehpiehnate a halpiehna thu ama kungah a gen uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Ama in amate kungah, “Tami Galilee-te in tam banga a thuoh ziehun Galilee midang zosie sangin a mawzaw hi dingin na ngaisun uh amah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Hi lo hi, ke’n kang ci hi; note na kisiakia sih uleh no zong amate bangin na mangthai sieng ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Ahi sihle Siloam tausang in a netlia mi sawm le giette, Jerusalem-a teng midang zosie sangin a gilozaw dingin na ngaisun uh amah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Hi lo hi, ke’n kang ci hi; note zong na kisiakia sih uleh amate bangin na mangthai sieng ding uhi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tua ciengin ama in tami thugentena a gen hi: “Mi khat in a lengga um sunga kisuon theikung khat nei hi; tua theiga lo dinga a pei ciengin a ga bangma a mu sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tuaci’n um cingpa kungah, “En vawi! Tami kum thum sung theiga ka sui vangin khat beh ka mu sih hi. Phua dawh ta’n! Bang dingin leitang mawh nawngkaisah ding ahei?’ a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Ama in, ‘Siepa aw, a phung kimkot lei to-in ehlei ka sun masangsie kum khat sung tam bangin omsah phot lai in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Maikum cienga ang ga leh a hoi hi ding a, ang ga sih leh phua bep in,’ ci-in a dawng hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Sabbath ni-in ama in kikhopna inn sungah thu a hil hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tua zaw lien ciengin khum munah hlabua in kum sawm le kum giet sung a poisah numei khat a om hi. Ama pen a cingbawngin a dingtang thei sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Jesu in tua nu a mu ciengin ama kungah hlanin, “Numei aw, na natna panin na dam ta hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Ama in tua nu tungah a khut a ngah ciengin ama dingtang thei pai lienin Pasien’ min a phat hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Ahi vangin Jesu in Sabbath ni-in cina a damsah ziehin kikhopna inn uhpa lungthah a, mihonpite kungah, “Nasep hun ding ni guh tah a om hi; a kidamsah dingin tuami hun sungin hing pei unlen, sabbath ni-in hing pei sih un,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tua ciengin Topa in dawngkia-in amate kungah, “No mihoi kipangte aw, sabbath ni-in a buh panin na bawngte uh ahi sihle na laate uh hla-in noma ciet in tui pie dingin na peipi sih uh amah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Satan in kum sawm le kum giet sung a na hencip Abraham’ tanu ahi tami numei nu khu sabbath ni-in a kihencipna panin sutdawh dingin kilawm hi lo amah? a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Ama in tami thu a gen ciengin a langpangte zosie a maizum mama uhi; tuale a bawl na lamdang zosiete ziehin mipi zosie a lungdam uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tua ahi ziehin ama in, “Pasien’ manggam bang tawh kibang ahei? Bang tawh gente ding ka hei?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Mi khat in um sunga a the ankam tang tawh a kibang hi; tua ankam tang khangin singkung golpi suoh a, vana leng vate in a bate tungah bu a bawl uhi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tuale ama in a genkiana-ah, “Pasien’ manggam bang tawh gente ding ka hei?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Numei khat in vainel law thum a zelsuoh donga a saw tol tawh kibang hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Khuopi le khuotate khatzaw khat nawhin Jesu pei kawikawi a, thu a hil kawmin Jerusalem lam manaw-in a zin hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Mi khat in ama kungah, “ Topa aw, mi tawmno khat beh in hutdamna nga ding amah?” ci-in a dong hi. Ama in amate kungah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />“Kot kawcih lam tawn a lut ding hakat un; azieh pen note kunga kang ci-in, mi tampi a lut sawm vua, ahi vangin a lut zo sih ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Khatvei inn neipa tho-in kot a khazaw ciengin note in zong a pulamah dingin kot na kiu ding vua, “ Topa aw, kot ei hon in,” na ci ding uhi. Tua ciengin ama in note kungah, ‘Hei pana hing pei ci kang thei sih uhi,” ci-in a dawng hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Tua ciengin note in, ‘Nang tawh an ne-in tui i dawnton ngai zo a, ka gawldung teng vuah zong thu nei hil zo hi,” na ci ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Ahi vangin ama in note kungah, “Ke’n kang ci-in, no hei pana ang pei ci ke’n kang thei sih hi; no, migilote zosie aw, ka kung panin peidawh ta un,” ang ci ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Pasien’ manggam sungah Abraham, Isaac, Jacob, le kamsangte zosie omin, note a pulamah ang kipaimang na mu uh ciengin kaana le hagawina a om ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Tua ciengin nisuona, nitumna, leilu le leitaw lam panin mite pei-in Pasien’ manggam sungah an a ne ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />A nukhia-te masa-in a masate nukhia tahpi ding hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Khum hun laitahin Pharisee-te pawlkhat pei-in ama kungah, “Tam panin kihemkhie ta’n, azieh pen Herod in ang tha sawm hi,” a ci uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Ama in amate kungah, “Va pei ta unlen tua ngie kungah, ‘En in, tu ni le zing ciengin dawite notdawhin cinate ka damsah ding a, a ni thum ni-in ka nasep ka man sieng ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Hinanle tuni, zing cieng le thai sung teng ka ma nawtsuohin ka pei ding hi, azieh pen Jerusalem pulamah kamsang khat a kitha ding pieng thei lo hi,’ a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Jerusalem, Jerusalem aw, kamsangte thatin, na kunga ang kisawlte suong tawh na seplia a, aapi in a hla kawmah a tate a huoi bangin na tate tamveipi ka huoi nuom vangin na nuom sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />En in, na innte kinuasie zo hi. Ke’n kang ci-in, ‘ Topa’ min tawh ang pei pa in thupha nga taheh,’ na ci hun uh ang tun masangsie-in kei nei mu nawn sih ding uhi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="14" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Sabbath ni khatin Pharisee-te makaipa khat’ inn ah an ne dingin Jesu a pei ciengin amate in ama na encih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tua lien laitahin ama mai-ah cibaw natna a nei mi khat a om hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Jesu in thukham theite le Pharisee-te kungah, “Sabbath ni-in cina damsah ding pen thukham tawh kituoh amah, kituoh lo ahei ? ci-in a dong hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Ahi vangin amate a sip dide uhi. Tuaci’n Jesu in tuapa hlan a, ama damsahin a peisah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tua ciengin ama in amate kungah, “Note lahah mi khat in sabbath ni-in a tapa ahi sihle a bawngtang khat tuikhuh sungah na kie leh, a lakhie pai lo ding koi om na hi uh ahei?” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Amate in tami thu a dawngkia sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Lenglate in uliente to nading mun thupite a teel lam uh Jesu in a thei ciengin amate kungah thugentena khat a gen hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />“Mi khat in mopawi sim dingin ang hlat ciengin mi thupite tona-ah to sih un, tua banga na to uleh mopawi sim dinga a kihlan mite lahah no sanga thupizaw mi om kha thei ding hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />tuale ang hlanpa hing pei-in na kung vuah, ‘Tampa tona awn in,’ ang ci thei ding a, tua ciengin maizum pipi-in a niem pen munah na to ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Nangma ang kihlat ciengin pei-in a niem pen munah to zaw in, tuaci’n na kungah ang hlanpa ang pei ciengin, “Lawm aw, tona sangah to in,” ang ci ding a, tua ciengin sabuoi tunga na topi mi zosie muna-ah ang kizatah ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Azieh pen a kilamsangtawm mite kiniemkhieh ding a, a kiniemkhiehtawm mite kilamsang ding hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Ama a hlanpa kungah zong ama in, “Sun an nehna ah hile, nitah an nehna ah hile mi na hlat ciengin na lawm na guolte, na sanggamte, na tanaute ahi sihle mihau na vengte na hlan sin, tua hile amate in nang hing hlanin ang thuhkia thei ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Ahi vangin pawi na bawl ciengin mizawngte, mipoite, khelbaite, le mittawte na hlanzaw in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tua hileh amate in nang hing thuhkia zo lo ding ahi ziehin thupha na nga ding hi, azieh pen midihte a thawkia ni ciengin nang ang kithuhkia ding hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Nitah an a nehpi lenglate khat in tam thu a zah ciengin ama kungah, “Pasien’ manggam sunga an ne ding poma hampha sam vuoi izaw!” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tua ciengin Jesu in ama kungah, “Mi khat in pawi lienpi khat bawl a, mi tampitah hlan hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Pawi anneh hun ding ciengin ama in a mi hlatte kungah, “Hing pei un; azieh pen na zosie a baisa-in om zo ta hi,” ci-in a gen dingin a silapa a sawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Ahi vangin amate in a kibangin hamlap a sui ciet uhi. Amasa pen pa in, ‘Lo khat ka lei a, keima pei-in ka va-et lo a poimaw hi; nei theisiem dingin kang thum hi,’ a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Adang khat in, “Bawngtang kap nga ka lei a, tuate ka va sin ta ding hi; nei theisiem dingin kang thum hi,’ a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Adang khat leuleu in, “Zi nei zo pan lien ka hi hi, tua ahi ziehin kang pei thei sih ding hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Tuaci’n silapa pei-in a pupa kungah tam thu teng a gen hi. Tua ciengin inn neipa lungthahin a silapa kungah, ‘Khuopi gawldung gawlvai tengah va naw pei ta’nlen, mizawngte, mipoite, mittawte, le khelbaite hing zawpi in,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Tuale silapa in, ‘Sie aw, nei sawl bangin ka sem zo ta a, mun awng lai veve hi,’ a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Tua ciengin a pupa in a silapa kungah, ‘Lamlien le lamneute-ah pei inlen ka inn ah mi a dim thei nadingin amate hing pau lutsah in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Azieh pen, ke’n note kang ci-in, a kihlante khat beh in ka pawi an a ciem kha sih ding hi,’ ci hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Ama tawh mihon tampite khuol a zin vua, tuale kinua hei-in amate kungah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />“Ka kunga ang pei mi poma in a nu le a pa, a zi le a tate, a sanggam pasalte le a sanggam numeite tham lo, ama’ hinna nangawn a muda sih leh keima’ nuazui a suoh thei sih ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Ama’ singlamte puo-a ei zui lo poma ka nuazui a suoh thei sih ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Bangzieh ahei cile mi khatpo in tausang khat a lam sawm leh tua inn zaw sieng nadingin a sum a kicing diei, a kicing sih diei, ci-in to-in tuot masa phot lo ding amah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Tua bang hi sih mawh leh khuombul suong a phu zaw ciengin a ban zom zo ta sih leh, a mu mi zosie in zako ding a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />‘Tampa inn lam kipan sam napi a zo thei ta sih hi,” a ci ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Ahi sihle galkap tul sawm a nei kumpi khat in galkap tul sawmni tawh a sim dinga ang kuon kumpipa khat ka zo diei mah, ci-in to-in ngaisun masa phot lo ding amah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Ama in a zaw ngap sih leh tua adang kumpipa a gamlapi-a a op lai-in kilemna thu gen dingin ama kungah patong a sawl ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Tua ahi ziehin note lahah a neisa zosie a nuasie lo poma ka nuazui suoh thei lo ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />“Ci pen hoi hi; ahi vangin tua ci in a alna mansuo leh bangci ki-alsah theikia ding ahei?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Leitang adingin lah a hoi sih a, ehlei dingin zong a hoi tuom sih hi; amate in tua khu a pulamah a paimang ta uhi. Zah nading bil nei tapo in za taheh!” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="15" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tua ciengin a thugen ngai dingin siehdongte le mawneite in ama a nai uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tuale Pharisee-te le thukham hil siete in, “Tam mipa in mawneite ngai-in an a neton hi,” ci-in a phun uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tuaci’n ama in amate kungah tami thugentena a gen hi:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Note lahah mi khat in tuu zakhat nei a, tua sung panin khat mansuo leh, gamlahah sawmkuo le kuote nuasie-in a mu masangsie-in tua a mang pen a sui lo ding koi na hi uh ahei?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Ama in a mu ciengin lungdamin a liengko-ah a puo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Inn a tun ciengin a lawmte le a vengte hlanin, ‘Ei lungdampi un, azieh pen a mangsa ka tuu ka mukia ta hi,’ a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tua ma bangin ke’n kang ci-in, vantung gamah kisiakia ding a kisam lo midih sawmkuo le kuote sangin a kisiakia mawnei mi khat tungah lungdamna lienzaw ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />“Tua ahi sihle numei khat in dangka tang sawm nei-in khat mansuo leh tua nu in meivah vahin innsung teng phietin a mu masang limtahin sui lo ding amah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tua sum a mu ciengin a lawmte le a vengte hlanin, ‘Ka sum mansuo ka mukia ziehin ei lungdampi un,’ a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Ke’n kang ci-in, tua ma bangin a kisiakia mawnei mi khat ziehin Pasien’ vantung mite lungdam mama uhi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tua ciengin Jesu in, “Mi khat in tapa ni nei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />A nauzaw pa in a pa kungah, ‘Pa aw, ka nga ding gou teng ei pie in,’ a ci hi. Tuaci’n a pa in a neisa teng a ta tegel a hawmpieh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Ni tawmkhat zaw ciengin a naupa in a neisa zosie khawmin a gamla mama gam khatah zin a, tua gamah a neisa teng a phengzah sieng ta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />A neisa teng a zah sieng zaw ciengin tuami gam buppi-ah kielpi tung a, ama zong neh ding a kitasam ta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tuaci’n tua gammite khat kungah sum thalaw dingin pei a, tuapa in a lo-a voh an pie dingin a sawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Ama in vohte neh begapte a dugaw mama a, ahi vangin koima in bangma khat beh pie lo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Ahi vangin ama in thu a ngaisut theikia ciengin, ‘Ka pa guoisa nasemte in khawn tal loin an khamval tampi a nei ding vua, ahi vangin kei lah tam sungah gilkiela a si ding ka hi ta hi!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Kei tho-in ka pa kungah ka pei ding a, “Pa aw, vantunga Pasien le nangma mai-ah ka khiel zo ta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Na tapa ci dingin zong ka kilawm nawn sih hi; na guoisa na nasemte khat bangin kei ei bawl lel in,’ ka ci ding hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tuaci’n ama tho-in a pa kungah a pei hi. Ahi vangin gamlapi mun khatah ama a gei laitahin a pa in na galmu a, khuotuohuoi a sa hi; tuale ama zong tai phei pai-in na ngawngkawi a, a na nam vatuh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Tua ciengin a tapa in a pa kungah, ‘Pa aw, Pasien le nangma mai-ah ka khiel zo a, tu-a kipanin na tapa ci dingin zong ka kilawm nawn sih hi,’ a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Ahi vangin a pa in a silate kungah, ‘Mallangin puon hoipen khat hing la unlen ama silsah un; a khutah khutsip bunsah unlen a kengah kedap zong bunsah un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Tuale bawngno thau khat manin go unlen, tua khu ne-in lungdamin pawi bawl vai;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />azieh pen tami ka tapa a sisa ahi a, ang hingkia ahi hi; ama pen a mangsa ahi a, tu-in a kimukia ahi hi!’ a ci hi. Tuale amate lungdamin pawi bawl a kipan uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />A tapa uzaw pen lo kuon hi a, vai pei-in inn a tun kuon ciengin tumging le lamnate a za hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Ama in silate khat hlanin bang kibawl ahei, ci-in a dong hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Tuapa in, ‘Na naupa ang tungkia a, cidam ludamin ama ang tun ziehin na pa in bawngthau khat a gaw hi,’ a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Tua ciengin ama lungthah mama a, inn sungah a lut nuom ta sih hi. A pa pusuohin ama a va zawl ta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Ahi vangin ama in a pa kungah, ‘En in! Tami kum tampi sungin silate khat bangin nangma adingin na ka sem a, na thu zong kang niel ngai sih hi; hizongle ka lawmte tawh ka guolnop thei nadingin keelno khat zong nei pie ngai nai sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Ahi vangin tu-in numei pahtatte tawh a neisa teng a netum tami na tapa ang tun ciengin bawngno kivathau na go hi!’ a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Tua ciengin a pa in ama kungah, “Ka ta aw, keima tawh nang na om den a, ka neisa zosie nangma-a’ ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Ahi vangin tami na naupa pen a sisa ahi a, ang hingkia ahi hi; ama a mangthapsa ahi a, a kimukia ahi tah ziehin kipahna le guolnopna bawl ding a kilawm ahi hi,’ ci hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="16" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tua ciengin Jesu in a nuazuite kungah, “Mihau pa khat in neisa kem khat nei a, tua neisa kempa in a neisa teng phengzah gawp hi, ci-in kiheh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tuaci’n ama in tuapa hlanin ama kungah, ‘Na tungtang thu ka zahte bang cidan ahei? Nang pen ka neisa kempa hi nawn lo ding na hi ziehin na sum zehna sazien teng ei ap in,’ a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tua ciengin neisa kempa in a lungsim sungah, “Tu-in ka pupa in ka nasep panin ei tawpsah ahi tah leh bang ka ci ta diei? Lei lai dingin lah ka tha a hat sih a, khutdaw nget ding lah ka maizum hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Neisa kempa hina panin ei kitawpsah zaw ciengin mite in a inn vua zin ei tunsah thei nadingin ka sep ding teng ka khensat zo hi,’ a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tuaci’n a pupa tunga leiba ba teng a banbanin hlan a, amasa pen pa kungah, “Nang in ka pu lei bangza na ba ei? ci-in a dong hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Ama in, ‘Sathau bung zakhat ka ba hi,’ a ci hi. Tua neisa kempa in ama kungah, ‘Leiba ciemtena laibu va lazuai ta’nlen tosuhin sawm nga-in giel in,’ a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tua ciengin adang khat kungah, ‘Tuale nang in ka pu leiba bangza na nei ei?’ ci-in dong hi. Ama in, ‘Mangbu seu zakhat,’ a ci hi. Ama in tuapa kungah, ‘Na leiba ciemtena lai la inlen, to-in seu sawm gietin giel in,’ a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tuale a dihtat lo neisa kempa pen pilvang tahin a gamtat ziehin a pupa in ama a pahta hi; azieh pen khuovah tate sangin leisiet mite a nasepna vuah a pilvangzaw uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Keima in note tungah kang ci-in, tuate a tawp ciengin kumtawn inn sungah ang lamdot ding lawm suina-in tua a dih lo haunate na zang un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Themno khat tunga a citah poma a tampi tungah citah a, themno khat tunga a citah lo poma a tampi tungah zong citah lo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tua ciengin a dih lo hauna tunga na citah sih uleh koi in note adingin hauna tahtah ang ap ngam ding uh ahei?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Midang khat’ neisa tunga na citah sih uleh koi in noma adingin ang ap ngam mawh ding uh ahei?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Koima’ sila in pu ni’ na semton zo lo hi; bang ding ahei cile ama in khat muda-in adang khat it ding a, ahi sihle khat belin adang khat a simmaw ding hi. Pasien’ na le hauna’ na na semton thei sih ding uhi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Sum du Pharisee-te in tam thu zosie a zah ciengun ama a nuisan uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tuaci’n amate kungah, “Mite mai-ah no le no na kidihsah vangun Pasien in na lungtang uh a thei hi; azieh pen mihingte in manpha a sah mama uh nate pen Pasien’ muna-ah a kidahhuoi ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />“John hun cieng dong thukham le kamsangte’ thu na kizang hi; tua zaw lang kalsie Pasien’ manggam lungdamna thu kihil a, tua gam sungah mi zosie in pau lut ding a hanciem uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Hinanle thukham laibu sunga om laimal cindawncie khat a manthai ding sangin van le lei a manthai ding baizaw lai hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />“Mi khatpo in a zi a khul a, midang khat tawh a kinun leh ama angkawm suoh a, a kikhulsa numei tawh a kinung mi zong angkawm ma ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />“Khumin mihaupa khat in puon ausan le saihadiel puon sil a, nisimin pawi bawlin nuomsa tahin a om hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tuale a tunkotah a pumtanga hima vei Lazarus a kici mizawng khat kikoi a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />ama in a gilkiel phat nadingin mihaupa’ sabuoi panin a kie annengte a dugaw hi; uite nangawn pei-in a hima a liepieh zel uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Tua mizawng pa si a, vantung mite in Abraham tawh omton dingin ama a puo uhi. Mihaupa zong si-in a kivui hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Misikhuo ah gawtna thuohin a op laitahin a khuodah leh a gamlapi mun khatah Abraham le a gei-a om Lazarus a galmu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Ama kiko-in, “Pa Abraham aw, kei ei khuotuo inlen, tami meili lai-ah gimna nahpi tahin thuoh ka hi ziehin Lazarus in a khutme dawn tui die-in ka leii a votsah dingin hing sawl in,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Ahi vangin Abraham in, “Ka ta aw, na hin sungin sil hoi teng na nga a, tua ma bangin Lazarus in sil hoi lo teng a nga lam phawh in; hizongle tu-in tam sungah ama nuomsa-in a om a, nang in gimna na thuoh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Tamte zosie banah i kikal vuah guom thuhpi khat om a, tam lam panin no lamah a galkai nuomte a galkai thei sih vua, tua lam panin ko lamah zong koima a galkai thei sih hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Ama in, ‘Tua ahileh Pa aw, ka pa inn ah ama ei sawlpieh in, kang thum hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Azieh pen keima in sanggam pasal nga ka nei a, tami bawlsietna munah amate ang tun lo nadingun ama in ei va hilpieh taheh,’ a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Abraham in, ‘Amate in Moses le kamsangte a nei uhi; amate’ thu na ngai ta uheh,’ a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Ama in, ‘Hi lo hi, Abraham aw, misite lah panin khat ka sanggamte kungah va pei leh amate kisiakia ding uhi,’ a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Ama in tuapa kungah, ‘Amate in Moses le kamsangte’ thu a man nop sih uleh misite lah nangawn panin mi khat thokia nanle zong a tahsang tuom sih ding uhi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="17" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Jesu in a nuazuite kungah, “Puana a piengsah thei hun le nite ang tung valon ding hi, ahi vangin tuate a piengsah mi khatpo in gimna a thuoh ding hi!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tami naupangte lahah khat a puasah sangin a ngawngah an gawina suongtum khat khai-in tuipi sungah kikhie leh ama dingin hoizaw lai ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />No le no kikem siem un! Nuazuite adangkhat ang maw leh tua a maw mipa phawh unlen, a kisiakia leh a mawna maisah un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Na tungah mi khat in ni khat sungin mawna sagi vei ang bawl a, tuale nangma lamah hing kihei-in sagi vei ma, ‘Ka kisia ta hi,’ ang ci leh a khielna na maisah in,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Sawltahpite in Topa kungah, “Ka upna uh hing khangsah in!” a ci uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Topa in amate kungah, “Note in ankamtang cie upna na nei uleh tami nailung kung tungah, ‘Kiphungkal inlen, tuipi sungah va po in,’ na ci thei ding vua, na thu uh ang mang ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />“Lokaina pan hile, lo lai-a a tuucinna panin hile na silapa uh vai ang tun ciengin note lahah koi in, ‘Hing pei inlen sabuoi-ah an ne pai in,’ ci ding ahei?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />‘Nitah an ei thua inlen, ne le dawnin ka op laitahin na nasep puon silin ka neh ding ei bawlpieh in; tua zaw ciengin ne pan lel in,’ a cizaw sih ding amah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Silapa in a kisawl teng a bawl ziehin ama tungah lungdam a ko ding uh amah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tuaci’n note in sep dinga ang kisawl zosie na sep zaw ciengun, ‘Kimanna a nei lo silate i hi uhi; i sep dinga kilawmte beh ma a sem i hi lel uhi,’ na ci uhi,” ci-in a dawng hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Jerusalem lam zuonin Jesu a pei laitahin Samaria gam le Galilee gam kikal tawnin a pei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Khuo khat a lut leh miphah sawm in ama a nai phei uhi. Amate in a gamla sim khatah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />“Jesu ka Mangpa aw, kote ei hepi in,” ci-in a kiko uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Jesu in a mu ciengin amate kungah, “Pei unlen siempute va kivelsah ta un,” a ci hi. Amate a pei ciengun a dam pai ta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tua ciengin amate lahah khat in a dam lamtah a kithei ciengin kinuale-in awging tah tawh Pasien a phat hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Jesu keng phungah khupbawhin ama kungah lungdam a ko hi. Tuapa pen Samaria mi khat ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tua ciengin Jesu in, “Mi sawm tah kidamsah hi lo amah? Adang kuote hei sungah a om ta uh ahei?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tami gamdang mipa khat simlo, Pasien phat dinga ang kinuale koima om lo ahi amah?” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tua ciengin ama in tua mipa kungah, “Tho inlen pei in, na upna in nang ang damsah zo hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Khatvei Pharisee-te in bang hun ciengin Pasien’ manggam hing tung ding ahei, ci-in a dong uleh ama in, “Pasien’ manggam pen mu thei dinga limte tawh ang tung ding ahi sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Amate in, ‘En un, tam tahah om ei!’ ahi sihle, ‘Khumtah ah om ei!’ a ci thei sih ding uhi. Azieh pen a tahtahin note lahah Pasien’ manggam a om hi,” ci-in a dawng hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Tua ciengin ama in a nuazuite kungah, “Ni khat ni ciengin Mihing Tapa’ nite lahah ni khat beh na mu nop hun uh ang tung ding a, ahi vangin na mu sih ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Amate in note kungah, ‘Khunah en vuo!’ ahi sihle, ‘Tanah en vuo!’ ang ci ding uhi. Pei sih unlen zong zui sih un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Azieh pen tunphe in van mong khat pan mong khat dong a tan ma bangin, Mihing Tapa’ ni ciengin zong tua bang ahi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Ahi vangin ama in gimna tampi thuoh masa ding a, tulai khang mite in ama a niel ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Noah hun lai ma bangin Mihing Tapa’ ni ciengin zong a pieng ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Tembaw sungah Noah lutin tuizin tung a, amate a unpi-in a suhsiet ni dongin an ne tuidawn, kipi kitengin a om uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Tua ma bangin Lot hun lai-in zong amate in ne-in dawnin, lei-in zua-in, suonin lamin a om vua,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />ahi vangin Lot in Sodom khuo a nuasie ni-in vantung panin kat le meikuong guo bangin zu a, amate a unpi-un a susie mang hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Mihing Tapa ang kilah ni ciengin zong tua ma bangin a pieng ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Khum ni ciengin inn khum vuma om poma inn sunga kikoi vante la dingin kumsuh sih heh; tua ma bangin lolai-a omte zong inn ah nua peikia nawn sih heh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Lot’ zi phawh gige un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />A hinna uh humbit dinga a hanciemte in a hinna uh a tan ding vua, a hinna uh a tan mite in a hinna uh a humbit ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Ke’n kang ci-in, khum zan ciengin lupna tunga a lumton mi ni lahah khat kila-in khat kinuasie ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />An suton numei ni lahah khat kila-in khat kinuasie ding hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Lo lai-a om mi ni lahah khat kila-in khat kinuasie ding hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Tua ciengin amate in, “ Topa aw, tua thute hei sunga hing pieng ding ahei? ci-in a dong uhi. Ama in amate kungah, “Siluong opna popo-ah langtate a kikhawm ding uhi,” ci-in a dawng hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="18" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tua ciengin Jesu in lungkie lo-a thu nget den ding a kisapna thu tawh kisai-in thugentena tawh thu a hil hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Khuopi khatah Pasien a zatah lo, mi zong a thusim lo thukhen mang khat a om hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tua khuo sungah meigong numei khat om a, thukhen pa kungah pei den mielmuolin, ‘Ka langpa tungah thu a tangin ei khenpieh in,’ a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Ama in bapikhat sung khenpieh nuom lo a, ahi vangin a nua ciengin, ‘Pasien zatah loin mihing zong ka thusim sih vangin,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />tami meigong numei in ei subuoi zing ahi ziehin, ama hing pei-in ei gimsah nawn lo nadingin a thu tangtahin ka khenpieh ta ding hi,’ ci-in ngaisun hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tuale Topa in, “A dih lo thukhen mangpa thugen ngaisun un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Sun le zanin ama kunga a kiko ama’ teelsa mite tungah Pasien in thu a tangin khenpieh lo ding amah? Amate panpi ding a kiheh ding amah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Ke’n kang ci-in, ama in amate tungah thu a nawkhen ding hi. Hizongle Mihing Tapa ang pei ciengin leitungah upna a mu lai diei mah?” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Amau le amau thuman kisa-in a kimuong vua, midangte a simmaw mite tungah zong tami thugentena a gen hi:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />“Thu ngen dingin biehinn ah mi ni a peito vua, khat pa pen Pharisee ahi a, adang khat pen siehdong pa ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Pharisee-pa dingin thu ngen a, ‘Pasien aw, kei pen midangte bangin misuomte, neisa lahpiehte, angkawmte, ahi sihle tami siehdong pa nangawn tawh zong ka kibah lo ziehin nangma tungah lungdam kang ko hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Nipi kal khat sungin an nivei ka tang a, ka nga zosie lah panin sawm-ah-khat zong ka pie hi,’ a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Ahi vangin siehdong pa pen a gamlapi ah ding a, van lam nangawn nga ngam loin a awm bengin, ‘Pasien aw, mawnei mi keima ei hepi in!’ ci-in thu a ngen hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Ke’n kang ci-in, a khat pa sangin dihtangsa-in inn ah tampa a pei hi; azieh pen ama le ama a kitawisang poma in niemkhiehna thuoh ding a, ama le ama a kiniemkhieh poma in tawisangna nga ding hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Jesu in a tham thei nadingin mite in ama kungah naupangte a peipi uhi; tuale a nuazuite in a mu ciengin amate a phawhsie uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Ahi vangin Jesu in ama kungah naupangte hlanin, “Keima kungah naupangte hing peisah unlen kham sih un; bangzieh ahei cile Pasien’ manggam khu tua bang mite-a’ ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />A tahtah a kang ci-in, naupang banga Pasien’ manggam a sang lo poma tua gam sungah lut ngai lo ding hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Uhpa khat in Jesu kungah, “Sie Hoipa aw, kumtawn hinna ka nga thei nadingin bang bawl ding ka hei? ci-in dong hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Jesu in tuapa kungah, “ Bang zieha kei mihoi nei ci ahei? Pasien khat longal koima a hoi a om sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Nang in thukham teng na theisa ahi hi: ‘Ang na kawm sih ding hi; tuol na that sih ding hi; mi neisa na gu sih ding hi; zuou teci na pang sih ding hi; na nu leh na pa zatah ding hi,’ ci hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Ama in, “Tam teng zosie ka neu lai-a kipanin ka zui siengsa ahi hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Jesu in tam thu a zah ciengin tuapa kungah, “Na khat na kisam lai hi. Na neisa zosie zua inlen, mizawngte tungah na sumte hawm in, tua hile van gamah gou na nei ding hi; tua ciengin hing pei inlen ka nua ei zui in,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Ahi vangin ama hau mama ahi ziehin tam thu a zah ciengin a da mama hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Jesu in ama en kawmin, “ Pasien’ manggam sungah mihaute a lut ding bang a ci hamsat diei izaw!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Mihau khat, Pasien’ manggam sunga a lut ding sangin kala-oh khat, hieumei hawm sunga a lut ding baizaw lai hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Tami thu a za mite in, “Tua bang ahileh koi in gupna nga zo mawh ding ahei?” a ci uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Ama in, “Mihingte adinga ahi thei lote Pasien adingin hi thei hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Tua ciengin Peter in, “En in, ko zong ka inn ka lo uh nuasie-in nang kang zui uhi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Jesu in amate kungah, “A tahtah a kang ci-in, Pasien’ manggam ziehin a inn, a zi, a sanggamte, a nu a pa-a kipan a tate nuasie-in,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />tam khanghun ah a za tampi nga a, ang tung ding hunah zong kumtawn hinna a nga lo ding koima a om sih hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Tua ciengin Jesu in sawm le nite hlanin amate kungah, “En un, Jerusalem ah i peito ding a, kamsangte in a na gielsa Mihing Tapa’ thu zosie a tangtung ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Azieh pen Gentile mite khut sungah ama ki-ap ding hi; tuale ama kisimmaw-in, kizako-in, kicilphit ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Amate in ama a sat gawp zaw uh ciengin a that ding vua, tuale a nithum ni ciengin a thokia ding hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Ahi vangin a nuazuite in tam thute zosie bangma a thei sih uhi; amate tungah ama’ thugente ki-im ahi ziehin a kigen thute a deina a man zo sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Jericho khuo ah Jesu a tun kuonin lam gei-ah mittaw khutdawngen khat na to hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Tua mun nawhin mihonpite pei a zah bepin ama in bang thu ahei, ci-in dong hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Amate in, “Nazareth mi Jesu ang pei ahi hi,” ci-in a gen uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Tua ciengin ama kiko a, “David Tapa Jesu aw, kei ei hepi in!” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />A mai-a om mite in ama a sip khinkhian nadingin khautahin thu a pie uhi; ahi vangin ama in ,“David Tapa aw, ei hepi in,” ci-in a kinah ko semsem hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Jesu khawlin ama kungah ang peipi nadingun thu a pie hi; tuale a gei a tun ciengin Jesu in,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />“Bang hing bawlpieh leng na nuom ei?” ci-in dong hi. Ama in, “ Topa aw, khuo ei musahkia in,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />Jesu in ama kungah, “Khuo mu ta in; na upna in nang ang damsah zo hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" />Ama in thakhatin khuo mu pai a, Pasien’ min phat kawmin a nua a zui pai hi; mi zosie in a mu ciengun Pasien a phat uhi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="19" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Jericho khuo ah Jesu lutin a peisuoh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tua sungah Zacchaeus kici siehdong uhpa khat om a, ama a hau mama hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tuapa in Jesu mu nuom mama a, ahi vangin ama mi tuntom khat ahina zieh le mihon a tam seng ziehin a mu zo sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tuaci’n ama na matai a, Jesu a mu thei nadingin lampi gei-a theitheh kung tungah na ka hi, azieh pen ama tua lampi zui ding ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Khumi munah Jesu a tun ciengin khuodah to-in ama kungah, “Zacchaeus aw, mallangin hing kumsuh in; azieh pen tuni-in na inn ah kang tung ding hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tuaci’n Zacchaeus zong kumsuh pai bingbiengin kipahtahin a tungsah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Amate zosie in tam thu a mu ciengun, “Mawnei khat’ inn ah zin tung dingin a pei hi,” ci-in ama a phunsan uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Khum munah Zacchaeus dingto a, Topa kungah, “ Topa , en in, ka neisa alang mizawngte ka pie ding hi; solna tawh mi khatpo’ neisa ka lahpieh a op leh a za li-in ka lokia ding hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tua ciengin Jesu in ama kungah, “Ama zong Abraham suonlehlahte khat ahi ziehin, tuni-in tami inn ah hutdamna a tung zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Azieh pen a mangthai mite sui ding le a hundam dinga Mihing Tapa ang pei ahi hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Jerusalem ah Jesu a tung dihtah a, amate in Pasien’ manggam ang tung pai dingin ngaisun uh ahi ziehin, a thugente a na ngai laitahun ama in a ban zomin thugentena khat a gen hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tuaci’n mi thupi khat in kumpi thuneina a nga nadingin a gamlapi-a om gam khatah a pei zaw ciengin a kilekia hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Ama in a silate mi sawm hlanin sumtang pound sawm pie-in amate kungah, “Kang tunkia masangsie tam teng tawh summet na bawl un,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Ahi vangin a gammite in ama a muda ziehun ama’ nua-ah kamtai khat a sawl vua, ‘Kote ei uh dingin tam mipa ka dei sih uhi,’ a cisah uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Kumpi thuneina ngasa-in a kilekia ciengin, amate tungah a sum apsa silate in summet bangza nga uh ahei, ci a thei nadingin ama kungah a hlansah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />A masa pen pa a mai-ah pei-in, ‘ Topa aw, nei sum pieh pound khat in pound sawm metsah hi,’ a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Ama in, ‘Hoi sep cie, Sila hoi aw! Thu neuno khatah muonhuoi na hi ziehin khuopi sawm uh in,’ a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tua ciengin a nina pa pei-in, ‘ Topa aw, nei sum pieh pound khat in pound nga metsah hi,’ a ci ciengin,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Ama in tuapa kungah, ‘Tuale nang in khuopi nga uh in,’ a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tua ciengin adang khat pei-in ama kungah, ‘ Topa aw, tam sungah na pound a om hi. Puonthem khat tawh tua sum ka tun hi,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />azieh pen nang mi genhapi khat na hi ziehin na khol lopi na la a, na tu lopi zong na at hi, tua ahi ziehin nang kang giing hi,’ a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Ama in tuapa kungah, ‘Nang a gilo silapa aw, na kamham ma tawh thu kang khen ding hi! Kei pen mi genha khat ka hi a, ka khol lona munah la-in ka tu lona-ah ka at lam nei thei amah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Tua banga ei thei na hi leh bang dingin sumkholna-ah tua sumte na koi lo na hei? Tua hileh kei kang peikia ciengin ka sumpi a met tawh ka nga ding hi,’ a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Ama in a gei-a dingte kungah, ‘Ama kung panin pound khat la unlen, pound sawm a neipa pie un,’ a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />(Tuale amate in tuapa kungah, ‘ Topa aw, ama in pound sawm nei zo ta!’ a ci uhi.)
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />‘Ke’n kang ci-in, a neite kipiehbe ding a, ahi vangin bangma nei lote tung panin a neisun nangawn uh kilahpieh ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Ahi vangin amate tungah kumpi sem dinga ei dei lo ka galte tawh kisai-in amate tam sungah hing peipi unlen, keima muna-ah amate that un,’ ci hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Ama in tam thu teng a gen zaw ciengin na mapei-in Jerusalem zuonin a peito hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Olive a kici mun a om Bethphage le Bethany khuo a tun kuon ciengin ama in a nuazuite ni sawl a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />“Na mai vua khuo ah pei unlen, khuo sung na lut ciengun koima’ tuon ngai nai lona laano khau-a kikhi khat na mu ding uhi. Hing sut unlen tanah hing kai ta un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Mi khatpo in, ‘Bang dinga na sut uh ahei?,’ ci-a ang dawh uleh, ‘ Topa in tulmaw hi,’ ci-in dawng un,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Tuaci’n a mi sawlte pei-in a gen bangin a mu uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Amate in laano khau a sut laitahun a neite in, “Bang dinga laano khau na sut uh ahei,” ci-in a dong uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Amate in zong, “ Topa in tulmaw hi,” a ci uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Tua ciengin Jesu kungah laano a peipi uhi; tua laano tungah a puon uh a pha zaw ciengun Jesu a tuongsah uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Laano tung tuongin lampi-ah Jesu a pei laitah in mite in lampi tungah a puonte a pha uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Olive Muol panin kumsuhna mun a tun kuon ciengun, nuazui mihonpite in a mu ngaisa uh vanglietna nasep zosiete ziehin kipahtahin awging tawh Pasien phat ding a kipan vua,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />amate in, “ Topa’ min tawh ang pei kumpipa in thupha nga taheh! Vantungah kilemna om hinlen, a sang pen munah minthanna om taheh!” a ci uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Mihonpite lahah Pharisee-te pawlkhat in Jesu kungah, “Siepa, na nuazuite khawlsah in,” a ci uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Ama in, “Ke’n kang ci-in, tam mite ham lo-a a sip uleh suongte kiko ding uhi,” ci-in a dawng hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />Jerusalem a tun kuon, khuopi a mu ciengin ama in tua khuopi kaa a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />“Nang nangawnin tuni-in kilemna a piengsah theite thei lacin izaw! Ahi vangin tu-in na mu lo nadingun tuate kiselin a om hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" />Na kimkotah na galte in kul bawlin hing imtawmin, mun zosie panin ang bume ding hun ang tung ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" />Amate in nang le na kulpi sunga na tate tuoldenna-in ang nei ding vua, na sunga suong khat beh zong a kiciengsa-in a nuasie sih ding uhi; azieh pen note in Pasien kung pan ang kivilna hun na phawkhah lo zieh uh ahi hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" />Tua ciengin biehinnpi sungah Jesu lutin khum sunga om vanzuate a notmang hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" />Tuale ama in, “Ka inn in thungetna inn kici ding hi,” ci-in kigiel hi. Ahi vangin note in misuomte kibuhna phuolpi na suohsah ta uhi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" />Ama in nisielin biehinnpi sungah thu hil a, siempu liente, laihil siete le mipi makaite in tha dingin a sui den uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" />Ahi vangin amate in a thugente lunglut tahin a ngai ziehun bangma a law thei sih uhi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="20" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Ni khat, Jesu in biehinnpi sungah mite thuhilin lungdamna thu a gen laitahin siempu liente, thukham hil siete, le upate pei-in ama kungah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />“Bang thuneina tawh tamte na bawl ahei? Tami thuneina koi ang pieh ahei? Ei gen in,” a ci uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Jesu in amate kungah, “Ke’n zong thu khat kang dong ding hi. Hing gen un:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />John’ ki-baptize na pen vantung pana ang pei amah, ahi sihle mihing tung pana ang kipan ahei?” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Amate khatlekhat kikumin, ‘Vantung pan hi,’ ci leih ama in, ‘Bang dinga ama na muon lo uh ahei?’ ei ci ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Ahi vangin, ‘Mihing kung pan ahi hi,’ ci lei lah John pen amate in kamsang khatin ngaisun uh ahi ziehin mi zosie in suong tawh ei seplia ding uhi,” a kici uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tuaci’n amate in hei sunga hing pei ahei ci ka thei sih uhi, ci-in a dawng uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tua ciengin Jesu in amate kungah, “Ke’n zong tamte bang thuneina tawh ka bawl ahei ci kang gen sih ding hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Jesu in mipite kungah tami thugentena a gen hi: Mi khat in lengga lei khat bawl a, huonhlote kawmsahin gamdang khatah sawtveipi a zin hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Lengga law hun a tun ciengin lengga lei pana pieng ama’ tanh ding teng a nga thei nadingin lohlote kungah nasem khat a sawl hi; ahi vangin lohlote in a nasempa na sat gawpin a khutguohin a peisah uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Ama in adang nasem khat sawl leuleu hi; amate in tuapa na sat gawpin a na zako vua, a khutguohin na peisah uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Ama in a thumveina nasemte khat ma sawlkia leuleu hi; tuapa zong tua ma bangin liemsahin a notmang uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tua ciengin lengga lei neipa in, “Bang law ding ka hei? Ka it ka tapa ka sawl ding hi; tua hile amate in na zatah kha sam ding uhi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Ahi vangin lohlote in ama a mu uh ciengin, “Tampa pen gamhluo ding pa ahi hi; a gamh teng i nga thei nadingin ama i that ding hi,” ci-in a kikup zaw ciengun,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />lengga lei pulamah notmangin a that uhi. Tua ahile lengga lei neipa in lohlote bang a law ta diei?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Lengga lei neipa pei-in lengga huon lohlote that ding a, lo zong midangte a pie ding hi,” a ci hi. Amate in tam thu a zah ciengun, “Tam bangin pieng da taheh!” a ci uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Ahi vangin Jesu in amate enin, “Tua ahile: “Innlamte’ nilkhiet suong pen innkiu suongpi a suoh zo hi,” ci-a a kigiel thu khu bang a cinopna adiei?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tua suong tunga a pua mi poma guoicim ding a, tua suong in a khiehkhah poma a dengguoi ding hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Jesu in tam thugentena a gen pen amate a cinopna ahi lam thukham hil siete le siempu liente in a thei uh ciengin, tua hun sung ma-in Jesu a man nuom vua, ahi vangin mipite a giing zel uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tuaci’n amate in gam-uhpa’ thuneina le vaihawmna sungah a ap thei nadingun, ama’ kam tawh ama thangsie dingin mihoi kipang thukante sawlin a endapsah uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Tua mite in, “Sie aw, na thugen le na thuhilte man mama a, mai-et tuom nei loin Pasien’ lampi mantahin na hil lam kang thei uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Caesar kumpipa tungah sieh pieh ding pen thukham tawh a kituoh amah, a kituoh sih ahei?” ci-in a dong uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Ahi vangin ama in a ngian uh thei a, amate kungah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />“Sum denarii khat ei lah un. Tami koi’ lim le koi’ min ahei,” a ci hi. Amate in, “Kumpipa’ lim le min ahi hi,” a ci uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Jesu in amate kungah, “Tua ahile kumpipa’ nate kumpipa tungah pie unlen, Pasien’ nate Pasien tungah pie un,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Amate in mipite mai-ah ama’ thugen tawh thangsie zo loin, a thudawnte zong lamdang a sa mama vua, ham lo phun loin a sip dide uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Misite thawkiana om lo hi, a ci Sadducee-te pawlkhat ama kungah pei-in
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />thukhat a dong vua, “Sie aw, Moses in mi khat’ sanggampa in ta nei loin a zi a sisan leh, tua mipa in tua meigongnu kinunpi-in a sanggam pa adingin ta hinpieh ding hi, ci-in giel hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Tu-in sanggam pasal sagi a om hi; a tapen pa in zi nei a, ta nei loin a si hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Tua ciengin a nina pa
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />le a thumna pa in tua nu ma a kinunpi vua, tua ma bangin a sagi-un ta nei loin a si sieng uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />A tawpna ah tua nu zong a si hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Tua ahi ziehin thawkia ni ciengin tua nu koi pen’ zi ahi diei? Azieh pen a sagi-un ama a kinunpi kim uhi,” a ci uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Jesu in amate kungah, “Tami khanghun a mite in mopi mohla-in a om uhi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />ahi vangin sina panin thokia-in ang tung ding khang hun a mun nga dinga kilawm mite in mopi loin mo zong a hla sih ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />A tahtahin amate a si thei nawn sih ding uhi, azieh pen thawkiana’ tate ahi ziehun amate pen vantung mite le Pasien’ tate tawh kibang ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Misite a thawkiana thu pen Moses mama in theubawh tangthu sungah na lah a, tua sungah Abraham’ Pasien, Isaac’ Pasien, le Jacob’ Pasien, na ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Tu-in ama pen misite’ Pasien hi loin a hingte’ Pasien ahi zaw hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Tua ciengin thukham hil sie kimkhat in, “Sie aw, na thugen hoi mama hi,” ci-in a dawng uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Azieh pen amate in thu dangte a dong ngam nawn sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />Tua ciengin Jesu in amate kungah, “Bang dinga amate in Messiah pen David’ Tapa hi a ci thei uh ahei?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />Azieh pen David mama in late sung ah, ‘ Topa in ka Topa tungah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" />na galte ka keng ngahna-a ka bawl masangin ka zietlamah to in,’ ci hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" />Tua bangin David in ama pen Topa na ci hi; tuaci’n ama, a tapa bangci hi thei ding ahei,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" />Mi zosie’ zahin Jesu in a nuazuite kungah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" />“Thukham hil siete na kidawm un. Puontuol silin amate a vah kawikawi nuom vua, vanzuana mun lah po-ah zatah hopi ding dei-in, kikhopna inn sungah tona thupi pente-ah a to nuom se vua, pawi bawlna munte-ah zong uliente tona-ah a to nuom na lai uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" />Amate in meigongte’ inn a valtum vua, a kilimlawm dingin thu a sawt nget giap uhi. Amate in mawsah thukhenna a lienzaw a thuoh ding uhi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="21" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Jesu a khuodah leh mihaute in sumpi kuong sunga a sumpi khieh uh a mu a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />mizawng meigongnu khat in zong dangka san tang ni a khieh a mu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Ama in, “A tahtah a kang ci-in, tami mizawng meigongnu in amate zosie sangin a tam khiehzaw hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />azieh pen amate zosie in a hauna uh panin a khieh uh ahi a, ahi vangin tua nu in a zawn kawmkal panin a kiva nading a neisun teng a khie sieng hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Mi pawlkhat in biehinnpi pen suong hoi mamate tawh a kizep dan le Pasien tungah letsongte a kipieh dan teng a gen ciengun Jesu in,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />“Na mu uh tami nate tawh kisai-in suong khat tungah adang suong khat beh kithuop loin a kicipzan hun ang tung ding hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Amate in, “Siepa, tam thute bang cih ciengin ang pieng ding a, tam thute ang pien kuon ciengin bang limte ang om ding ahei? ci-in a dong uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Jesu in, “Koima in ang puimang lo nadingun kidawm un; azieh pen keima’ min suongin mi tampi ang pei ding a, “Kei, ama ka hi hi! ‘A hun ang nai ta hi!’ ang ci ding uhi. Tua bang mite na zui sih un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Gal kikapnate le kumpi ledona thute na zah ciengun zau sih un; azieh pen tam thute ang pieng masa ding ma ahi a, ahi vangin hun tawpna in ang zui pai nai sih ding hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tua ciengin Jesu in amate kungah, “Minam khat le minam khat, gam khat le gam khat ang kido ding hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />zil nahpi-in ang ling ding a, mun tuomtuom ah kielpi le pul natna ang tung ding hi; tuale van tung panin dipkuotna le lim lamdangte ang pieng ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />“Ahi vangin tam thute ang tun masangin keima’ min ziehin amate in note hing manin ang bawlsie ding uhi; amate in kikhopna innte le thong sungah ang ap ding vua, keima’ min ziehin kumpite le gam-uhte mai-ah ang kipeipi ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tami in na teci pan nading uh hun lemtang ang pie ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tuaci’n note in na lungsim sung vuah na kihut nading uh ngaisun masa sih un;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />azieh pen keima in na langte uh koima khat beh in nielin ang nan zo lo nadingun gen ding thute le pilna kang pie ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Na nu na pate, na sanggamte, na hieng nasante ule na lawm na guolte nangawn un zong ang khie ding vua, pawlkhat in thana na thuoh ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Keima’ min ziehin mi zosie in ang muda ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Ahi vangin na samzam uh khat zong a mangthai sih ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Note in thuohzawhna tawh na hinna uh na hu zo ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />“Galkapte in Jerusalem khuopi a kui-im na mu uh ciengin tua khuopi a kisuhsiet nading ang nai zo hi, ci-in thei ta un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Tua hun ciengin Judea gam a omte muol tungah tai-in, khuopi sunga omte in khuopi nuasie-in, gam sunga omte in khuopi sung lut nawn sih uheh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Bang zieh ahei cile tua hun pen a kigielsa thu zosie a tangtun nadinga phulah ni ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Khum ni ciengin naupaite le nausen nawi tepsah laite in gimna a thuoh ding uhi! Azieh pen leitungah gimna lienpi tung ding a, tam mite tungah lungthahna a tung ding hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />namsau tawh a si ding vua, minam zosiete lahah salin amate kikai ding hi; Gentile-te’ hun a tun masangsie, Gentile-te in Jerusalem khuopi a tuoncil ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />“Ni, hla le aasite tungah limte ang om ding a, tuipi le tuihuol gingte ziehin leitung minamte lahah hamsatna le buoina a om ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Leitunga ang pieng ding thute a ngaisutna ziehun mite zau-in sibup ding uhi, azieh pen vantunga om nate kiling ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Tua ciengin Mihing Tapa in vanglietna le minthanna sang pen tawh meiilum lahah ang pei amate in a mu ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Tu-in tam thute a pien ding ang kipat ciengin na kitatkhiet ding uh a hun ang nai ta ahi ziehin na lu uh phongin khuodah un,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Tua ciengin Jesu in thugentena khat a gen hi: “Theikung le singkung zosie en un;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />a nate ang dawn ciengin khuokhal hun ang nai zo ta hi, ci-in na thei uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Tua ma bangin tam thute ang pien na mu ciengun Pasien’ manggam ang nai ta hi, ci-in thei ta un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Ke’n a tahtah a kang ci-in, tam thute zosie ang tun masangsie tami khang mite a mangthai sih ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Vanpi le leipi mangthai zong nanle ka thute mangthai lo ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />“Na pilvang bo un, na lungsim uh lalthangin zukhamna le hinkhuo ading lunghimawna in ang thazaw gawp ding a, na muonmaw lo laitahun thang kisai bangin note tungah tua ni ang tung ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Ang tung ding tam thute zosie panin na suotah thei nadingun thahatna na nei nading ule Mihing Tapa mai-ah na din thei nadingun a tawntungin thu ngenin na pilvang un,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Ama in biehinnpi sungah nisielin thu hil a, zan ciengin Olive muolah a gieh dingin a pei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Biehinnpi sunga a thuhilna ngai dingin zingmawngin mi zosie a thobai uhi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="22" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tu-in Peisan Pawi a kici Tolsawlo Anlum Pawi hun a nai ta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Siempu liente le thukham hil siete in mihonpi a giin ziehun Jesu tha thei nading lampi a suidap uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tua ciengin sawm le nite lahah khat ahi Judas Iscariot kici pa sungah Satan a lut hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />ama pei-in siempu liente le biehinncing palihbute tawh Jesu leheh dan ding a kikum uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Amate a nuom mama vua, sum pieh dingin a kithukim uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tuaci’n Judas Iscariot zong thukim a, mipite’ op lo kalin amau’ khut sungah Jesu leheh thei nading hun lemtang a sui hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tua ciengin Peisan tuuno tawh biehpiehna kibawl ni ahi Tolsawlo Anlum Pawi a tung hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tuaci’n Jesu in Peter le John sawlin, “Pei ta unlen i neh ding Peisan Pawi ankuong va bawl ta un,” ci-in a gen hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Ama gel in, “Hei sungah va bawl ta gel leng na dei ei? ci-in ama a dong uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Jesu in ama gel kungah, “Ngai gel in,” a ci a, “Khuopi sung na lut cieng gelin tui beel a tui puo pasal khat tawh na kituoh ding uhi; ama lutna inn ah ama zui gel inlen
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />innteh pa kungah, ‘Siepa in ka nuazuite tawh Peisan Pawi an ka neh nading uh zin tunna innkhan hei sung ahei, ei dongsah hi,’ va ci ta un,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Ama in a kipuosa innkhan tungnung pen a khan gol khat ang lah ding hi. Eite adingin tua munah na bawl khol gel in,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tuaci’n amate pei-in a kung vua a gen bangin a mu mintah vua, tua munah Peisan Pawi an neh ding a siemkhol gel hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />A hun a tun ciengin sawltahpite tawh sabuoi-ah Jesu a toton hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Jesu in amate kungah, “Gimna ka thuoh masangin note tawh tami Peisan Pawi an nehton ding ka lunggul mama hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />azieh pen ke’n kang ci-in, Pasien’ manggam sungah tam thu a tangtun masangsie-in ka ne nawn sih ding hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tua ciengin ama in hai la-in lungdam a ko zaw ciengin, “Tami hai la unlen, note lahah hawm un;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />azieh pen ke’n kang ci-in, Pasien’ manggam ang tun masangsie tu-a kipanin lenggazu ka dawn nawn sih ding hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tua ciengin khomun zong la-in lungdam a ko zaw ciengin balkehin, “Tami in note dinga ang kipie ka pumpi ahi hi. Kei nei phaw nadingun tam bangin bawl un,” ci-in amate a pie hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tua ma bangin nitah an a neh zaw ciengun hai zong la-in, “Tami hai in note dinga ang luongkhie ka sisan tawh a kikipsah thuciemna tha ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Ahi vangin en un, keima ei leheh pa’ khut in sabuoi tungah keima tawh a om hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />A kisesa bangin Mihing Tapa pei ding a, ahi vangin ama a leheh pa in gimna a thuoh ding hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Tua ciengin tam banga gamta ding koi pen hi ding ahei, ci-in khatlekhat a kidong uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Amate lahah koi lienpen ding ahei, ci-in a nuazuite khatlekhat a kisel uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Ahi vangin Jesu in amate kungah, “ Gentile kumpite in amate tungah uhna aana zang uhi; tuale amate tunga thunei mite pen thupha bawlte kici hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Ahi vangin no tua bang na hi sih ding uhi; note lahah a lienpen pa a neupen pa bangin om zaw ding a, makai pa nasem bangin om ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Sabuoi tunga a to pa le an piepa koi lienzaw ahei? Sabuoi tunga a to pa ahi sih amah? Ahi vangin kei pen note lahah anpie pa bang ka hi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Note pen gimna ka thuoh sunga ei thuohpite na hi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Ka pa in keima tungah gam ei pieh ma bangin,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />tuaci’n note in zong ka gam sunga ka sabuoi-ah anne tuidawnin na om thei nading ule thukhenna topha tungah to-in Israel minam sawm le nite tungah thu na khen thei nading uh ahi hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />“Simon, Simon aw, ngai vawi! Satan in buhum zoi banga ang zoi thei nadingin ang ngen zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Ahi vangin na upna na hlasuo lo nadingin thu kang ngetpieh zo hi; nang kiheikia ciengin na sanggamte na thakhausah in,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Tuale Simon in, “ Topa aw, thong le sina-ah nangma tawh peiton dingin a kigingsa-in ka om hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Jesu in, “Peter aw, ke’n kang ci-in, ‘Ama ka thei kha sih hi,’ ci-in tuni-in thumvei nei niel masangsie aah khuong lo ding hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Jesu in amate kungah, “Sum ip, thung-ip le khedapte keng lo-a kang sawl lai-in tasapna na nei uh amah? a ci hi. Amate in, “Bangma tasapna ka nei sih uhi,” a ci uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Tua ciengin Jesu in, “Ahi vangin tu-in sum-ip nei pa in keng hinlen, tua ma bangin thung-ip nei pa in zong keng heh. Namsau nei lo pa in a puon-ah zua-in lei heh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Azieh pen ke’n kang ci-in, “Thukham palsatte lahah ama kisimtha hi,” ci-a a kigiel tami Lai Siengtho kei tungah ang tung valon ding hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Amate in, “ Topa aw, en in, tam sungah namsau ni a om hi,” a ci hi. Ama in, “Tua ahile pha zo ta hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Jesu a pei ngai bangin Olive Muol tungah pei a, a nuazuite in ama a zui uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Khum munah ama a tun ciengin amate kungah, “Solna na thuoh lo nadingun thu ngen un,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />Tua ciengin amate kung panin suongse khat tan bang nuakin a, tuale khupdinin thu ngen a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />“Pa aw, na deina a op leh keima kung panin tami hai hemkhie ta’n; hizongle keima’ dei bang hi sih hinlen nangma’ dei bang hi taheh,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" />(Tua ciengin vantung panin ama kungah vantungmi khat kilang a, ama a thakhausah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" />A lunggim ziehin ama in nahpi-in thu ngen a, a khuosa sisan mal golpi bangin lei-ah a taa hi.)
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" />A thungetna panin ama a dinto ciengin a nuazuite kungah a pei leh amate da luo kisa-in a kimut laitah uh a tuohkha hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" />Tuale Jesu in amate kungah, “Bang dinga kimu na hi uh ahei? Tho unlen solna na thuoh lo nadingun thu ngen un,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" />Ama in thu a gen laitahin sawm le nite lahah khat ahi Judas a kici mipa makai-in mihonpite a tung uhi. Ama in Jesu nam dingin a a kung a neh hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" />ahi vangin Jesu in, “Judas aw, nang in khatvei napna tawh Mihing Tapa leheh ding na hi amah?” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" />A kima om mite in a thupieng ding teng a mu ciengun Jesu kungah, “ Topa aw, namsau tawh ka sat ta ding vuoi mah? ci-in a dong uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" />Tua ciengin amate lahah khat in siempu lien pa’ sila khat a sat leh a zietlam bil a bantan hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" />Ahi vangin Jesu in, “Tam kan bawl nawn sih un!” ci-in a bil thampiehin a damsah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" />Tua ciengin Jesu in ama man dinga a kuon siempu liente, biehinncing palihbute, le upate kungah, “Misuom khat a man ding bangin kei ei man dingin namsau le phohbul tawh ang kuon na hi uh amah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" />Biehinnpi sungah note tawh nisielin ka opton lai-in lah ka tungah khut na nga sih uhi. Ahi vangin tam pen na hun uh ahi a, khuomiel thunei hun ahi hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" />Tua ciengin amate in Jesu manin siempupa inn ah a peipi uhi. Ahi vangin Peter in a kihalin a zui hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="55" style="v" />Leituol laikim ah meitaw-in amate a toton laitahun Peter zong amate lahah a to hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="56" style="v" />Tua ciengin nasem numei no khat in mei gei-a a to Peter a mu bepin encienin ama kungah, “Tampa zong ama tawh kigop khat ahi hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" />Ahi vangin ama kilepin, “Numei aw, ama ka thei kha sih hi,” ci-in a niel hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="58" style="v" />Bakhat zaw ciengin midang khat in mu leuleu a, “Nang zong amate lahah khat hi ngel veteh aw,” a ci hi. Ahi vangin Peter in, “Hi sih veng aw, nang pa,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="59" style="v" />Tua ciengin nai khat bang a sawt ciengin midang khat ma in ama kungah, “Tam pa zong Jesu tawh kigop tahtah ahi hi; azieh pen ama Galilee mi khat ahi hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="60" style="v" />Ahi vangin Peter in, “Nang pa, na gen thu thei kha vawt sing!” a ci hi. Tua hun laitahin thakhatin aah a khuong hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="61" style="v" />Topa zong kihei-in Peter a en hi. Tua ciengin Peter in, “Tu ni aah khuon masangin thumvei nei niel ding hi,” ci-a Topa gensa thu a phawh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="62" style="v" />Peter zong pusuohin nahpi tahin a kap hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="63" style="v" />Tu-in Jesu a mante in zako le vuoh a kipan uhi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="64" style="v" />puon tawh a mit a tuompieh zaw ciengun, “Ang sat koi ahiei? Gen vawi,” ci-in a dong mielmuol uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="65" style="v" />Amate in ama tungah zakona kam tampi a zang uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="66" style="v" />Khuo a vah ciengin tangpi upa vaihawmte, siempu liente le thukham hil siete kikhawmin thukhen uliente mai-ah Jesu a peipi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="67" style="v" />Amate in, “Nang Messiah na hi leh ei gen in,” a ci uhi. Ama in, “Ke’n hing gen leng note in na um sih ding uhi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="68" style="v" />hing dong leng zong nei dawng sih ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="69" style="v" />Ahi vangin tu-a kipanin Pasien’ vanglietna zietlamah Mihing Tapa a to ding hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="70" style="v" />Amate zosie in, “Tua ahile nang Pasien’ Tapa na hiei mah? ci-in a dong uhi. Ama in amate kungah, “Na ci bangun ka hi hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="71" style="v" />Amate in a unpi-un, “Adang teci bang kisam lai ahei? Ama kam tehteh panin i za zo ta uhi!” a ci uhi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="23" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tua ciengin a kikhawm mipite dingin Pilat kungah Jesu a peipi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Amate in ama mawsah a kipan vua, “Tampa pen ka mipite lampielsah pa khatin ka mu vua, ama le ama Messiah ahi kumpi khat ka hi hi, a kici a, Caesar kumpipa tunga sieh ka pieh ding uh ei khah hi,” a ci uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tua ciengin Pilat in ama kungah, “Nang Judah-te’ kumpipa na hi amah? ci-in a dong hi. Ama in, “Na ci bangin ka hi hi,” ci-in a dawng hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tua ciengin Pilat in, “Tampa tungah khielna bangma ka mu sih hi,” ci-in siempu liente le mipite tungah a gen hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Ahi vangin amate in a hanaw tasem vua, “Ama in a thuhilna tawh Judea gam sunga om mipite a tawhnawi a, Galilee pana kipanin tam mun dong cieng nangawn ang tung hi,” a ci tentun uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Pilat in tam thu a zah ciengin tam pa Galilee mi amah, ci-in a dong hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Herod uhna gam sunga om ahi lam ama a kithei bepin, tua laitahin Herod zong Jerusalem-a om ahi ziehin ama kungah a peisah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Herod in Jesu a mu ciengin, a mu nopzaw sawt ta ahi ziehin a lungdam mama hi, azieh pen ama’ thu a zah ngaisa ahi a, a na lamdang bawlte khatpo zong a mu dingin a kilamen hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Herod in thu tampi dong a, ahi vangin Jesu in kam khat beh dawng lo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Siempu liente le thukham hil siete ding to-in, nahpitahin Jesu a mawsah uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Herod le a galkapte in simmaw bawlin a ko gawp vua, puontuol hoi mama khat a silsah zaw ciengun Pilat kungah a puohkia uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Khum ni-a kipanin Herod le Pilat khatlekhat a kilawmta uhi; tua masangin ama ni pen kimuda-in a kigalbawl den uh ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tua ciengin Pilat in siempu liente, makaite le mipite hlanin
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />amate kungah, “Note in tam mipa pen mipite a pui khiel khat bangin ka kungah nang peipi uh; na mai vuah ama ka sittel ciengin na mawmatna uh thute khat behah a mawna ka mu sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Herod in zong a mu tuon lo ziehin eite kunga ang puohkia ahi hi. A tahtahin ama in si nading za dongin bangma a bawl sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tua ahi ziehin ama satin ka hla ding hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Pilat in pawi hun sielin amau’ dei thongkie khat a hla ding thu a om mal ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tua ciengin amate kiko-in, “Tampa that in! Barabbas ei hlapieh in!” a ci uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />(Tampa pen khuopi sunga buoina a bawl zieh le mi a tha zieha thongkie ahi hi.)
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Pilat in Jesu a hla nuom ziehin amate kungah khatvei thu genkia a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />ahi vangin amate in, “Singlamte tungah ama that in, khailia in!” ci-in a awng teitei uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Amate kungah a thumveina thu gen a, “Ama in bang sietna a bawl zieha ka khailia ding ahei? Sina ding za-in khielna ama sungah ka mu sih hi; tua ahi ziehin ama satin, tua zaw ciengin ka hla ding hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Ahi vangin nahpi tahin amate a kiko vua, ama a kikhailia nading a kal teitei ciengun amau’ kikona in a zozaw ta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Tuaci’n Pilat in a ngetna uh banga pieh dingin thu a khen hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Ama in amau’ nget ahi kumpi langpanna le mi thana zieha thongkia pa hla a, amau’ dei banga a bawl dingun Jesu a pie hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Amate in ama a peikhietpi laitahun khuota pana ang pei Cyrene khuomi, Simon a kici pa khat a man vua, tuale singlamte patin Jesu’ nua lamah a puosah uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Mihon tampi in ama a zui vua, tuate lahah a awm uh bengin ama a kaa numei pawlkhat zong kihal hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Ahi vangin Jesu kinua hei-in amate kungah, “Jerusalem tanute aw, kei adingin kap sih unlen, noma ading le na tate adingin kapzaw un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Azieh pen amate in, ‘A ciing, ta nei ngai lo naubu, le nausen in a tep ngai lo nawite hampha mama hi,’ a ci ding uh nite ang tung valon ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Tua hun ciengin amate in muol sangte kungah, ‘Ka tung vuah hing cim ta un,’ a ci ding vua, muoltangte kungah, ‘Ei vuacip ta un,’ a ci ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Azieh pen amate in singhing bawn hici bawl uh ahileh a gaw ciengin bang a law ta bep ding vuoi?” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Migi lo ahi adang mi ni zong Jesu tawh thaton dingin a peipi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Lugu a kicina munah a tun ciengun amate in khum sungah Jesu a khailia vua, migi lo ni tegel zong a zietlamah khat, a veilamah khat a khailia uhi. (
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Tua ciengin Jesu in, “Pa aw, amate in bang bawl ci thei lo uh ahi ziehin a mawna uh na maisah in,” a ci hi.) Tuale amate in lai-ai sanin a puonte a hawm uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Mipite dingin a en uhi; ahi vangin upate in a zako vua, “Ama in midangte hundam hi; Pasien’ Messiah le a teel pa tahtah ahile ama le ama kihundam taheh!” a ci uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Galkapte in zong ama zako-in lengga tuithua a pie vua,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />“Judah-te’ Kumpipa na hi leh nang le nang kihun in!” a ci uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />A lutung son tahah, “Tampa Judah-te’ Kumpipa ahi hi,” ci-a kigiel lai khat kisuong hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Khum sunga a kikhai migilote lahah khat in, “Nang Messiah hi lo na mah? Nangma kihun inlen, ko zong ei hun in,” ci-in ama a simmaw ho hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Ahi vangin adang khat in, “Ama tawh kibanga mawna thukhenna thuoh hi napi cin, Pasien na giing sih amah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />Ei gel pen a man banga thu ei kikhen ahi a, i gamtatna tawh kituoha thaman nga i hi hi, ahi vangin tampa in khielna bangma bawl lo hi,” ci-in a phawhsie hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />Tua ciengin ama in, “Jesu aw, na kumpi gam sunga nang pei ciengin kei ei mangngil sin,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" />Jesu in, “A tahtah a kang ci-in, tuni-in keima tawh Paradise ah i omton ding hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" />Tua hunlaitah pen sunkim pawl hi a, nitah nai thum dongin gam buppi ah khuo a miel hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" />Tua hun sungin khimzing a, biehinnpi dalna puon phal ni kisuo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" />Tua ciengin Jesu in, “Pa aw, na khut sungah ka hlagau kang ap ta hi,” ci-in a aw neiza tawh a kiko hi. Tua bang a ci zaw ciengin a hu tawpna a sang hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" />Galkapmangpa in thupieng teng a mu ciengin Pasien’ min phatin, “Tam pa pen mawnei lo tahtah khat ahi hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" />Tam thute en dingin a kikhawm mipite in thupieng teng a mu ciengun awmbengsa-in inn ah a kilekia uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" />Ahi vangin a melthei zosie le Galilee gam pana a zui numeite ding to-in thupieng teng a gal-et uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" />Khumin Joseph kici mi hoi le mi thuman khat om a, vaihawm upa khat ahi vangin,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" />vaihawm upate’ deina le a sil bawlte uh a thukimpi sih hi. Ama pen Jew mite’ khuo Arimathea pana ang pei ahi a, Pasien’ manggam lawptaha a ngah den mi khat ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" />Pilat kungah ama pei-in Jesu luong a ngen hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" />Tua ciengin ama in a luong a khiesuh a, taangciin puon tawh tunin koima’ kivui ngai nai lona suong kilemsa han khatah a siel hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" />Khum ni pen kigin ni ahi a, sabbath kipan ding ahi ta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="55" style="v" />Galilee panin a zawpi numeite in zong a zui vua, amate in han le a luong bangci kivui ci a mu uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="56" style="v" />Tua ciengin amate kinuale kia-in panamtui le sathaute a baisa-in a koi uhi. Thukham dung zui-in sabbath ni-in amate a toi-om uhi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="24" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Nipi kal khat sunga ni masa pen ni, zingmawng phal vah tungin amate in a bawlsa uh panamtuite tawi-in hanah a pei uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Han a tun ciengun hankhuh sinna suongtumpi a kilia-a om a mu vua,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />ahi vangin a sungah a lut ciengun ama’ luong a mu sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tami thu ah lungmangin a op laitahun, a gei vuah puon telihleh a sil pasal ni thakhatin a ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Numeite zau-in tuolah a kunsuh vua, ahi vangin tua pasalte in, “Bang dingin misite lahah mihing sui na hi uh ahei? Ama tanah om lo hi, thokia zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Galilee gamah ama a op lai-in na kung vua ang gensa thute phawh un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Mawnei mite’ khut sungah Mihing Tapa kipie ding a, singlamte tungah kikhai-in a ni thum ni-in thokia ding hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tua ciengin amate in a thugensa a phawhkia vua,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />tuale han panin amate a kilekia ciengun sawm le khatte le midang zosie kungah tam thu teng a unpi-in a gen sieng uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Sawltahpite kungah tami thu a gen teng pen, Mary Magdalene, Joanna, James’ nu Mary, le amate tawh a omton numei dangte ahi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Ahi vangin thu kigente amate in tangmi bangin ngaisunin a tahsang sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Ahi vangin Peter dingto-in han lamah tai a, tuale ama kunin han sung a en leh a kitunna taangciin beh a mu uhi; tua ciengin ama in thupieng teng lamdangsa-in inn lam a zuonkia hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Khum ni ma-in amate lahah Jerusalem panin tai sagi bang a gamla Emmaus kici khuo khat zuonin mi ni a pei vua,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />tuale a pei kawmun a thupiengsa thute khatlekhat a kiholim gel hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tua banga holimin a kikup laitahun Jesu mama in va nehin ama gel tawh a zawhton hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Ahi vangin ama gel in Jesu ahi lam a thei lo nadingin a mit gel a kisinpieh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tuale Jesu in ama gel kungah, “Na lampei kawm vua na kikup uh bang thu ahiei?” ci-in dong hi. Ama gel zong dinkhawlin a da tuoh mama gel hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tua ciengin ama gel lahah Cleopas a kici pa in, “Jerusalem khuo-a a hawte lahah tu sawng tengin tua sunga thupieng a thei lo nang beh hi mal vateh” ci-in a dawng hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Jesu in ama gel kungah, “Bang thu ahei?” ci-in a dong hi. Ama gel in, “Nazareth mi Jesu tunga thupieng ahi a, nasepna le thugenna ah Pasien’ mai le mi zosie’ mai-ah a vangnei mama kamsang khat zong ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Sina thukhenna a thuoh dingin ka siempu liente ule ka ulien vaihawmte un ama pie-in singlamte tungah kikhailia hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Ahi vangin kote in ama pen Israel tankhie ding pa hi, ci-in ka lamen uhi. Hi hi, tam teng zosie banah tam thu teng a pien zaw tu-in a ni thumna ahi ta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Thamlo-in ko pawl sung panin numei pawlkhat in lamdang ei sasah mama uhi. Zingmawng khuovah behin hanah amate a va haw ta vua,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />khum sungah a luong a mu lo ciengun amate ang kilekia-in ama hingkia zo hi, ci-in a gen vantungmite’ kilahna a mu tahtahna uh kote tungah ang gen uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Ka pawlte uh pawlkhat zong hanah a va pei ta vua, numeite gen bang lienin a om a mu uhi. Ahi vangin Jesu a mu sih uhi,” a ci gel hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Tua ciengin Jesu in ama gel kungah, “Kamsangte thugen a tahsang thei lote le mimawte aw!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />A minthanna ah ama a lut thei nadingin Messiah in tam teng a thuoh ding a kisam ma hi lo amah?” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Tua ciengin Jesu in Moses le kamsang zosie tawh thu pan a, ama tawh kisai Lai Siengtho sunga kigen zosie ama gel kungah a hilcien hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />A pei nading uh khuo a tun kuon ciengun Jesu a peisuoh dingin a kisa hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Ama gel in nahpi-in a hlo vua, “Ko gel kungah hing gieh ta’n. Nitah lam ahi ziehin khuo zong a miel kuon ta hi,” a ci gel hi. Tuaci’n Jesu zong ama gel kunga gieh dingin inn sungah a lut hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Ama gel tawh sabuoi-ah a to ciengun ama in khomun la a, lungdam a ko zaw ciengin phalsuo-in ama gel a pie hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Tua ciengin a mit gel kihongin Jesu ahi lam a theisiem uhi; tuale ama gel’ muna panin ama a mang ta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Ama gel in, “Lampi-ah ei holimpi lai-a, Lai Siengtho ei hilcien lai-in zong i lungsim ei sukha tamal hi lo amah?” ci-in khatlekhat a kiho uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Khum hun ma-in, ama gel ding dawhin Jerusalem ah a kilekia ta uhi; tuale a kikhawmton sawm le khatte le a pawlte a mu uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Ama gel in, “ Topa thokia tahtah zo a, Simon kungah kilah zo hi,” a ci uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Tua ciengin lampi-a thupieng teng le khomun a phalsuo lai-a ama gel tungah ama a na kihilna dan teng a gen uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Tam thute a gen laitahun amate lahah Jesu ding a, “Note tungah kilemna om taheh,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Sihla mu kisa uh ahi ziehin amate zau-in a ling uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Jesu in amate kungah, “Bang ziehin zau-in, bang ziehin ei umla na hi uh ahei?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Ka khut le ka kengte en un; keima ka hi lam thei un. Ei tham unlen thei un; azieh pen sihla in kei nei bangin tahsa guletang nei lo hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Ama in tam thu a genzaw ciengin a khut le a keng a lah leuleu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />Lungdam kipahin lamdangsa-in a up thei nai vaset lo laitahun Jesu in amate kungh, “Tam sungah neh ding khatpo na nei vuoi mah?” ci-in dong hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />Amate in nga kihanggawsa khat a pie vua,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" />ama in tua khu la-in a muna vuah a ne hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" />Tua ciengin Jesu in amate kungah, “Note tawh ka opton lai-a na kung vua kang gen, Moses’ thukham laibu sung, kamsangte laibu sung, le late laibu sunga kigiel keima’ thu zosie ang tangtung valon ding hi, ka ci pen tami thu ahi hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" />Tua ciengin ama in Lai Siengtho thu a thei nadingun a lungsim uh honpiehin amate kungah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" />“Tua banga a kigiel ma bangin Messiah in sina thuohin a ni thum ni-in misite lah panin thokia ding a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" />Jerusalem-a kipan minam zosie kungah ama’ min tawh kisiakiana le mawmaina thu kihil ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" />Note zong tam thu-ah teci na hi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" />Tuale en un, ka Pa in ei khapsa thu na kung vuah kang sawl ding hi; tuaci’n a sangna panin vanglietna ang kisilsah masangin tami khuopi sungah na om tadi un,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" />Tua ciengin Jesu in Bethany khuo dongin amate zawpi a, tuale ama in a khut lamto-in amate thupha a pie hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" />Thupha a pieh laitahin amate kung panin ama kihem dawhin vantungah a kilato ta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" />Amate in ama bie-in lungdamna lienpi tawh Jerusalem ah a kilekia uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" />Tuale biehinnpi ah amate pei-in Pasien min a phat zing uhi.
  </para>
</usx>
